WEBVTT

01:33.560 --> 01:35.560
[Vehicles Honking]

01:37.800 --> 01:40.280
[Phone Ringing]

01:45.800 --> 01:46.440
Raja!

01:48.040 --> 01:49.919
[Phone continues ringing]

01:49.920 --> 01:50.560
Raja!

01:50.800 --> 01:52.040
[Footsteps approaching]

01:53.160 --> 01:53.560
Madam.

01:53.920 --> 01:54.560
Where is Gopi?

01:54.800 --> 01:56.160
His phone is ringing continously.

01:56.800 --> 01:58.280
Madam he went down.

01:58.440 --> 01:59.800
Maybe, he has gone out for a smoke...

02:00.280 --> 02:01.680
Why can't he just take his phone with him?

02:02.920 --> 02:03.800
I don't know madam.

02:04.800 --> 02:07.280
[Phone Ringing]

02:09.040 --> 02:09.560
Hello.

02:09.920 --> 02:10.800
Yes sir!

02:11.440 --> 02:12.680
He just went down for a coffee sir.

02:13.800 --> 02:15.040
His phone is in the cabin.

02:16.280 --> 02:16.800
What, sir?

02:18.920 --> 02:20.280
I was not aware about that sir...

02:21.280 --> 02:22.560
I will inform immediately sir.

02:23.280 --> 02:25.040
[Phones ringing continues]

02:26.560 --> 02:28.680
[Suspenseful music swells]

02:37.160 --> 02:39.160
[Muted Conversation]

03:01.440 --> 03:01.920
Boss.

03:03.160 --> 03:04.160
Yes, I got the news.

03:04.680 --> 03:05.440
It is shocking but...

03:05.680 --> 03:06.280
I can manage.

03:07.280 --> 03:08.160
I'll keep you updated.

03:09.040 --> 03:09.280
Yeah.

03:10.800 --> 03:14.440
According to the sources, We received,
These four boys ...

03:14.680 --> 03:18.680
Are working at a Bangalore based,
Sales company.

03:18.920 --> 03:21.799
The kidnappers—mid-twenties, young

03:21.800 --> 03:25.559
Are working at a Bangalore based,
Sales company.

03:25.560 --> 03:28.160
Oh God... what am I hearing?

03:29.680 --> 03:31.920
This news could
ruin our family’s name.

03:35.040 --> 03:35.920
Gopi... relax.

03:36.160 --> 03:37.160
[Chair creaks]

03:39.040 --> 03:41.440
The day, I hired those four boys
into this company...

03:41.920 --> 03:43.920
All our lives have been turned
upside down!

03:45.800 --> 03:47.560
The reason for all this chaos...

03:49.040 --> 03:50.560
Sadashivam, where is sadashivam?

03:50.680 --> 03:52.920
- Sir, he hasn’t come yet.
- What? He still hasn’t come?

03:53.560 --> 03:54.560
It’s already past five.

03:55.040 --> 03:57.040
Is he really working... or
pretending to be working?

03:57.680 --> 03:58.440
Check. Where is he right now?

03:58.560 --> 04:00.559
[News Anchor 1] - The future of India lies with its youth.

04:00.560 --> 04:03.919
They are smart, hardworking, and
key resources of our country.

04:03.920 --> 04:05.919
The 'Government' wants to empower these youths

04:05.920 --> 04:06.920
For their creativity.

04:07.160 --> 04:08.280
[Channel changes]
News Anchor 2 - As per our sources,

04:08.560 --> 04:12.159
These four youths are working in
Bangalore based sales organization.

04:12.160 --> 04:12.799
Wow!

04:12.800 --> 04:13.919
The media received the information.

04:13.920 --> 04:15.039
These... are my boys.

04:15.040 --> 04:16.159
As per sources...

04:16.160 --> 04:18.799
- I'm the one who trained them.
- And these four youths are in their twenties.

04:18.800 --> 04:20.159
Who are suspected to be involved

04:20.160 --> 04:22.159
You think Sadashivam is
just someone ordinary?

04:22.160 --> 04:25.160
The government of karnataka has
undertaken a new project.

04:25.560 --> 04:27.040
To improve the road saftey of the public.

04:29.440 --> 04:31.280
[Playful suspense music playing]

04:41.680 --> 04:45.440
- Hey... will you speak or not?
- Telugu or Tamil? Which one do you speak

04:45.800 --> 04:47.160
Tell me what happened?

04:47.680 --> 04:49.040
I honestly don’t know, sir.

04:49.560 --> 04:50.800
Stop annoying us...

04:51.160 --> 04:52.280
Tell us everything?

04:52.440 --> 04:53.560
[Footsteps echo through the station]

04:53.680 --> 04:53.920
What?

04:54.800 --> 04:56.040
[Glasses rattle]

04:58.040 --> 04:58.800
Brother!

04:59.040 --> 04:59.680
Is the tea hot?

04:59.920 --> 05:00.920
[Baton clatters]

05:01.680 --> 05:03.560
Serving it hot all this while...
and that's still not enough for you?

05:04.160 --> 05:06.560
First, I should kick him for serving you tea.

05:07.280 --> 05:08.040
Sir, Tea.

05:08.280 --> 05:08.800
Yes Sir!

05:09.280 --> 05:09.799
Yes Sir!

05:09.800 --> 05:11.160
[Chair creaks | Footsteps fades out]

05:12.280 --> 05:13.680
I'll make sure, The culprits are caught sir.

05:14.280 --> 05:15.680
[Playful music continues]

05:18.560 --> 05:20.680
[Footsteps approaching]

05:24.560 --> 05:27.560
- Did he reveal something?
- No sir not even a bit.

05:29.560 --> 05:31.680
[Footsteps closing in]

05:34.040 --> 05:35.160
Who are you guys?

05:35.560 --> 05:36.680
Where are you coming from?

05:38.280 --> 05:39.280
How many of you in total?

05:39.800 --> 05:40.280
Come on... speak up!

05:40.680 --> 05:42.440
How are you related to those four culprits?

05:42.680 --> 05:43.040
Sir!

05:43.440 --> 05:45.160
Sir, I’m just a Manager in a Sales company.

05:45.440 --> 05:47.440
I am the one who trained them sir.

05:48.160 --> 05:51.160
And..we call them... 'MRE' Sir.

05:51.800 --> 05:53.800
That's all i know Sir.

05:54.040 --> 05:54.560
Sir...

05:55.040 --> 05:58.439
MRE means 'Murder Rape Extortion'

05:58.440 --> 06:01.440
They are a new terrorist group,
Just like Al-Qaeda Sir.

06:01.680 --> 06:04.440
Sir! Looks like he’s in charge
of the whole team.

06:04.920 --> 06:06.160
Sir! No!

06:06.800 --> 06:11.560
MRE is Market Research... Executive Sir.

06:12.280 --> 06:13.440
Market.

06:13.920 --> 06:14.680
Research.

06:15.040 --> 06:15.680
Executive.

06:16.040 --> 06:16.560
Yes Sir!.

06:16.680 --> 06:18.160
You built a team that
surveys the whole 'Market'

06:18.560 --> 06:21.560
'Researches' the perfect spot to strike...

06:21.800 --> 06:23.679
And 'Execute' it... with deadly precision, Right?

06:23.680 --> 06:24.280
Oh God... sir, please!

06:24.920 --> 06:26.040
It is not like what you think sir.

06:26.280 --> 06:29.280
Sir! They work in my
team as a sales executives...

06:29.560 --> 06:31.800
And we use them for 'COLD-CALL' sir.

06:32.800 --> 06:34.919
Earlier you called them MRE...
and now you’re calling them 'COLD-CALL'?

06:34.920 --> 06:36.160
You think I’m some clown cop you can fool?

06:36.440 --> 06:37.160
Sir i'll explain it to you.

06:38.440 --> 06:40.560
In my twenty-three years of experience.

06:40.680 --> 06:45.680
With a single glance, I can tell his entire history.

06:48.280 --> 06:50.560
- What is COLD CALL?
- I'll tell you sir.

06:51.800 --> 06:53.280
Sir COLD CALL...

06:58.680 --> 07:00.440
Sir, could you all look up?

07:01.440 --> 07:03.920
[Playful suspense builds]

