08:08.160 --> 08:10.559
♪ You're one upper attitude
is what i solely object ♪

08:10.560 --> 08:11.279
♪ Oh hell nah ♪

08:11.280 --> 08:15.039
♪ What do we do? we are
caught in his web of lies ♪

08:15.040 --> 08:19.039
♪ If you keep pestering me,
