08:34.160 --> 08:36.040
♪ He's just a mess up ♪

08:50.160 --> 08:52.160
♪ He's just a mess up ♪

09:15.040 --> 09:16.679
'Market'

09:16.680 --> 09:17.799
'Research'

09:17.800 --> 09:19.920
Executives, MRE.

09:21.040 --> 09:21.920
Rajesh.

09:22.680 --> 09:24.279
'Market'

09:24.280 --> 09:25.439
'Research'

09:25.440 --> 09:26.800
Executives, MRE

09:26.920 --> 09:28.280
What is MRE?

09:28.560 --> 09:29.159
Dude!

09:29.160 --> 09:31.560
You want to apply without
even knowing what it is?

09:31.920 --> 09:32.440
Dude!

09:32.680 --> 09:33.800
You don't worry about that.

09:34.040 --> 09:35.680
Just tell me. What is MRE?

09:37.680 --> 09:38.159
Dude!

09:38.160 --> 09:39.560
Answer me! I’m asking you?

09:39.680 --> 09:41.920
Bro... I just shook my head no.

09:42.160 --> 09:42.800
Dude!

09:42.920 --> 09:45.680
How am I supposed to know
if you’re nodding your head?

09:47.160 --> 09:48.680
You’re testing my patience.

09:52.280 --> 09:53.160
Look...

09:53.680 --> 09:55.040
Koramangala, Fifth Block.

09:55.800 --> 09:56.800
Tell me how to get there?

09:57.160 --> 09:58.280
You spoke so much just now.

09:58.680 --> 09:59.280
Then...

09:59.560 --> 10:00.560
Go on. I’m sure you’ll find your way.

10:00.680 --> 10:01.679
I'm getting late...

10:01.680 --> 10:02.800
I'll leave bye...

10:03.160 --> 10:04.800
You take a leave.

10:05.160 --> 10:05.919
I'll manage

10:05.920 --> 10:07.320
[Phone keys tapping]

10:07.920 --> 10:09.280
[Phone ringing]

10:10.560 --> 10:11.920
Good morning 'Rapid'.

10:14.040 --> 10:17.680
Oh Yes! 300 meters, Towards the right,
Ground floor.

10:17.920 --> 10:20.680
[Upbeat music playing]

10:41.160 --> 10:41.800
Good morning sir.

10:42.280 --> 10:43.160
[Footsteps approaching]

10:52.440 --> 10:54.280
Wow!

10:54.800 --> 10:58.280
Bro! One way or the other,
I'm getting into this company

11:01.680 --> 11:02.440
Yes please!

11:02.960 --> 11:03.280
Hi.

11:03.800 --> 11:04.280
I am Gautham.

11:04.800 --> 11:05.440
Resume!

11:09.920 --> 11:12.160
[Paper rustling]

11:14.920 --> 11:15.560
Mam.

11:18.800 --> 11:19.800
[Footsteps approaching]

11:22.280 --> 11:23.440
- Hello!
- Hi.

11:25.920 --> 11:26.680
Wow!

11:30.040 --> 11:31.920
[Playful suspense music playing]

11:41.800 --> 11:42.280
Sir!

11:45.560 --> 11:45.920
Sir!

11:50.040 --> 11:50.680
Nonsense!

11:51.280 --> 11:52.919
Don’t you have the decency to knock?

11:52.920 --> 11:53.280
Sir...

11:53.680 --> 11:54.560
The door was open.

11:54.800 --> 11:56.920
And you... were at your
utmost inner peace.

11:57.560 --> 11:59.920
I can go... and come
back again, if you’d like.

12:00.040 --> 12:00.960
[Chair squeaks]

12:01.920 --> 12:02.440
Okay Sir...

12:04.680 --> 12:05.280
Sir...

12:08.440 --> 12:09.040
What's your name?

12:09.280 --> 12:09.800
Gautham.

12:12.160 --> 12:12.800
Gautham?

12:13.040 --> 12:13.920
Yes sir! It's me.

12:15.800 --> 12:16.680
Born in Bangalore?

12:17.280 --> 12:18.440
Bangalore... my hometown.

12:19.160 --> 12:20.159
Age 24?

12:20.160 --> 12:21.040
Perfect Sir!

12:21.280 --> 12:22.440
- Are you a fresher?
- Yes sir!

12:22.560 --> 12:23.799
Mind Fresh, Body Fresh.

12:23.800 --> 12:24.560
Fully Fresh, Sir!

12:25.280 --> 12:26.280
Then why sales?

12:26.560 --> 12:30.160
My friends tell me I could talk
my way into selling the entire village.

12:30.440 --> 12:31.800
Well... that's not my intention.

12:32.280 --> 12:33.560
I want to sell this company.

12:35.560 --> 12:37.280
I want to sell this company’s products.

12:37.680 --> 12:41.680
Because... I heard there's good
incentives in sales.

12:41.920 --> 12:44.040
Sales is one of the best ways
if you want to earn good money.

12:44.280 --> 12:45.920
Well, if you think money is everything... it’s not.

12:46.160 --> 12:47.159
Anyways have you ever sold anything so far?

12:47.160 --> 12:47.560
Yes Sir!

12:48.160 --> 12:49.160
My old girl friend.

12:50.040 --> 12:51.920
My old girl friend’s old phone, Sir.

12:52.040 --> 12:52.440
Phone.

12:53.160 --> 12:56.160
Apart from that, i have sold Tv, Fridge,
Washing machine, Mixer.

12:56.280 --> 12:57.040
Paper?

12:57.160 --> 12:57.680
That too, Sir.

13:00.040 --> 13:00.840
[Chair squeaks]

13:02.040 --> 13:04.560
Stella... please, hand me the envelope.

13:04.680 --> 13:05.040
Yeah.

13:05.280 --> 13:06.160
[Papers rustling]

13:12.920 --> 13:13.280
Thank you.

13:14.680 --> 13:15.799
I smell incense...

13:15.800 --> 13:17.040
[A celestial melody fills the air]

13:18.440 --> 13:20.560
- Greetings, Sir. Greetings, Madam.
- Yes.

13:26.040 --> 13:26.560
Oh God!

13:27.680 --> 13:28.280
Here Madam...

13:32.440 --> 13:33.680
Brother! Over here.

13:34.800 --> 13:39.160
Have you encountered any
challenges recently?

13:40.040 --> 13:40.800
Wow!

13:41.280 --> 13:42.039
What a question sir.

13:42.040 --> 13:42.680
Nice question.

13:44.040 --> 13:45.280
Recently?

13:46.560 --> 13:48.440
Recently...

13:48.800 --> 13:50.440
Difficult things i faced recently?

13:51.160 --> 13:54.160
Things i faced recently is...

13:54.280 --> 13:55.440
[Comical suspense intensifies]

13:56.680 --> 13:58.679
The cellophane tape that you have, sir.

13:58.680 --> 13:59.439
Yes, Yes.

13:59.440 --> 14:00.280
Could you... come a little closer?

14:01.040 --> 14:03.160
The tip of the cellophane tape, sir.

14:04.040 --> 14:06.919
Finding the tip of that tape...
is very difficult sir...

14:06.920 --> 14:07.680
Very difficult sir.

14:09.680 --> 14:10.560
Thank you very much.

14:11.160 --> 14:12.560
We'll get back to you.

14:13.800 --> 14:14.440
Am i done sir?

14:14.800 --> 14:15.440
Yeah Please!

14:16.800 --> 14:17.280
Thank you... Sir.

14:18.920 --> 14:20.440
Seriously! where exactly on
earth are you guys from?

14:25.040 --> 14:26.800
[Music intensifies]

14:41.040 --> 14:42.040
Forget it...

14:44.280 --> 14:46.560
Raja! Give this is to Sadashivam

14:46.920 --> 14:47.280
Bye!

14:47.440 --> 14:47.920
Oh...

14:48.560 --> 14:49.439
[Soft romantic music playing]

14:49.440 --> 14:49.920
By the way.

14:51.440 --> 14:53.040
May I know your sweet name?

14:53.560 --> 14:54.160
Why?

14:54.280 --> 14:56.440
Just like... that.

14:58.800 --> 15:00.560
First... ask him to get selected.

15:04.160 --> 15:05.160
Sir...

15:05.440 --> 15:06.680
[Celestial music continues]

15:08.560 --> 15:09.280
Come in.

15:09.800 --> 15:10.800
Sir time?

15:13.040 --> 15:13.919
Twelve twenty nine.

15:13.920 --> 15:15.040
Sir Seconds?

15:15.800 --> 15:18.040
Twelve twenty nine thirty five seconds

15:18.440 --> 15:19.280
One, Two, Three

15:20.040 --> 15:21.440
What are you counting?

15:21.680 --> 15:22.440
- Sit.
- Sir.

15:27.560 --> 15:28.160
Resume.

15:28.800 --> 15:30.560
[Papers rustling]

15:31.680 --> 15:32.040
Sir.

15:32.680 --> 15:33.040
Sir!

15:33.280 --> 15:34.800
- What?
- Right hand sir.

15:39.040 --> 15:40.559
- Balaji?
- Huh sir.

15:40.560 --> 15:41.920
- Bala G

15:42.040 --> 15:44.799
Chanting: O Lord of the Seven Hills! Govinda!

15:44.800 --> 15:46.560
- Okay, Okay, Okay.
- God Balaji sir.

15:46.680 --> 15:47.160
Okay.

15:47.440 --> 15:49.160
Tell me... something about sales.

15:49.800 --> 15:50.440
Sales Sir?

15:51.920 --> 15:52.560
Sales Sir?

15:52.680 --> 15:56.559
[Mantra chanting]

15:56.560 --> 15:58.160
Hence proved sales sir.

15:58.440 --> 16:00.280
- So... you don’t know?
- Don't know sir

16:01.280 --> 16:02.440
[Sighs]

16:02.800 --> 16:03.800
What are your hobbies?

16:04.440 --> 16:05.040
Palm Reading.

16:05.160 --> 16:05.679
Yes sir!

16:05.680 --> 16:07.279
- So... you’re good at astrology?
- Huh sir.

16:07.280 --> 16:07.920
Super.

16:08.160 --> 16:10.560
- Do you read for everyone?
- Yes sir, yes sir.

16:10.800 --> 16:11.560
Read mine... let’s see
what you’ve got.

16:11.680 --> 16:12.040
Sir!

16:12.920 --> 16:14.440
Again... left, right hand, Sir.

16:14.800 --> 16:16.280
[Music intensifies]

16:17.160 --> 16:18.920
Hey! That's mine.

16:19.440 --> 16:23.680
Oh! Oh! Super sir... looks fantastic.

16:23.800 --> 16:28.440
- Oh! Sir! Super sir, Full Fortune
- Super right! tell me more...

16:29.440 --> 16:30.160
How about my marriage?

16:31.040 --> 16:31.160
Two!

16:31.440 --> 16:33.280
- Two?
- No sir just one.

16:34.680 --> 16:35.560
Any kids?

16:38.040 --> 16:39.280
- Sir!
- What?

16:39.560 --> 16:39.920
Oh god!

16:40.160 --> 16:41.919
Can't see clearly?
Should I wash my hands for you?

16:41.920 --> 16:42.280
No Sir!

16:42.560 --> 16:44.159
- You have a problem sir.
- What problem?

16:44.160 --> 16:45.280
Sir you've been cursed.

16:45.680 --> 16:46.439
I didn’t understand that

16:46.440 --> 16:49.039
Sir... to explain everything, I need
at least three to four days with you.

16:49.040 --> 16:50.920
I have no idea what you’re saying.

16:51.160 --> 16:53.560
Sir... to explain everything, I’d need
at least three to four days with you.

16:53.680 --> 16:54.920
If you stay back,
Will you sort it out for me?

16:55.280 --> 16:57.279
- Idiot! That’s exactly what I told you!
- Oh... okay.

16:57.280 --> 16:59.279
Alright then... I’ll call you myself.

16:59.280 --> 17:01.559
Great! Okay, Sir... okay, Sir.
Thank you, Sir... thank you, Sir.

17:01.560 --> 17:03.160
[Footsteps approaching]

17:03.280 --> 17:03.919
Greetings sir.

17:03.920 --> 17:04.800
- Greeting sir...
- Greetings.

17:07.280 --> 17:09.920
[Sweet, gentle music rises]

17:18.680 --> 17:20.039
- Oh god sorry, sorry...
- I'm really sorry

17:20.040 --> 17:21.280
Leave it..leave it.. i'll take it for you.

17:21.680 --> 17:22.160
Yeah!

17:22.680 --> 17:23.680
- Sorry madam! Sorry madam!

17:24.680 --> 17:25.680
Madam?

17:26.600 --> 17:27.480
It's okay...

17:27.960 --> 17:28.840
Can i help you?

17:29.200 --> 17:30.600
Me want... job.

17:31.080 --> 17:32.960
- Oh! you have come for the interview.
- Yes.

17:33.080 --> 17:33.960
Resume.

17:39.720 --> 17:42.080
Resume, Resume, Resume...

17:44.720 --> 17:46.320
Please, sit... sit, sit.

17:46.600 --> 17:49.240
[Paper rustles]

17:49.720 --> 17:50.480
Mani?

17:51.200 --> 17:52.120
[Chair squeaking]

17:52.720 --> 17:52.960
Okay.

17:54.600 --> 17:57.720
Oh! You have one year of
experience in manufacturing?

17:58.320 --> 17:58.839
Okay.

17:58.840 --> 18:00.080
Tell me something about yourself.

18:00.600 --> 18:01.320
I'm Mani.

18:01.840 --> 18:03.599
My father Agriculture.
[Playful music playing]

18:03.600 --> 18:04.840
My mother house wife.

18:05.080 --> 18:07.320
My small sister college goes...

18:07.480 --> 18:08.480
I studied BE.

18:08.720 --> 18:10.200
Then Manufacturing.

18:10.320 --> 18:11.200
One year job.

18:11.480 --> 18:13.320
Covid company closed.

18:14.200 --> 18:17.960
All company employee... resign.
I do hard work.

18:18.840 --> 18:21.720
Dedication... yours obediently sir.

18:23.320 --> 18:24.320
Okay Mani.

18:24.600 --> 18:26.080
You need good communication skills.

18:26.200 --> 18:28.200
- Especially in English.
- English?

18:28.720 --> 18:29.960
Yes sir! I can able.

18:30.200 --> 18:31.720
Hundred percent effort

18:33.480 --> 18:36.080
Okay. What was your job profile
in your previous company?

18:36.600 --> 18:37.320
Profile?

18:41.480 --> 18:43.960
Can you explain the hierarchy
of your previous company?

18:44.200 --> 18:45.599
- Hierarchy?
- Yes

18:45.600 --> 18:46.479
Hierarchy?

18:46.480 --> 18:47.480
High Rocky?

18:47.840 --> 18:49.200
Hierarchy?

18:49.960 --> 18:51.200
Hierarchy

18:54.080 --> 18:55.320
Can i paper sir?

18:55.600 --> 18:57.480
Why is he asking for paper?

18:57.840 --> 19:00.080
[Playful music continues]

19:10.080 --> 19:11.840
What is he scribbling and sketching?

19:17.320 --> 19:19.480
Hey! Watch out... careful.

19:19.720 --> 19:20.720
Tell me.

19:20.840 --> 19:22.960
Sir... old company.

19:23.080 --> 19:24.600
Ground floor... Parking.

19:25.200 --> 19:26.600
First floor... Sales.

19:26.960 --> 19:29.720
Second floor... Finance, MD sitting.

19:30.080 --> 19:32.080
Third floor...

19:32.840 --> 19:35.080
Food... Eating place sir.

19:35.600 --> 19:38.600
- Why sales?
- Father Loan.

19:38.720 --> 19:41.720
Sister studies, Money want.

19:41.960 --> 19:42.480
Okay!

19:43.480 --> 19:46.480
What position would you see yourself in...
a year from now?

19:46.720 --> 19:47.840
[Music intensifies]

19:48.480 --> 19:48.960
Lead.

19:49.600 --> 19:50.600
Oh... Lead.

19:50.720 --> 19:52.320
- Yes sir.
- Mani.

19:52.480 --> 19:54.320
Thank you we'll get back to you.

19:56.320 --> 19:56.960
Okay...

19:57.200 --> 19:58.200
[Chair creaks]

19:59.600 --> 19:59.960
What?

20:01.200 --> 20:03.080
- Oh! thank you
- All the best sir.

20:03.840 --> 20:05.320
All the best for me...

20:06.720 --> 20:07.959
Seriously... where do you
guys even come from?

20:07.960 --> 20:10.479
Each one... completely unique...
with its own design.

20:10.480 --> 20:11.840
What? Ten lakhs for me?
[Folk music plays]

20:12.600 --> 20:15.600
I can’t even manage five rupees...
and you’re talking ten lakhs?

20:16.720 --> 20:17.320
What are the documents?

20:17.600 --> 20:18.200
You tell me...

20:18.480 --> 20:19.480
One minute please.

20:19.960 --> 20:21.200
[Folk music Continues]

20:25.960 --> 20:26.480
Tell me.

20:27.200 --> 20:29.720
- Pan card i have, Aadhar card i have
- Hello?

20:30.080 --> 20:30.960
- Excuse me!
- Passport.

20:31.080 --> 20:33.320
Passport... I will apply it today.

20:33.720 --> 20:35.320
- Photos.
- Hello!

20:35.480 --> 20:36.480
Go on... tell me what else, nonsense.

20:37.200 --> 20:38.480
[Phone ringing]

20:38.960 --> 20:39.840
One minute, One minute...

20:42.600 --> 20:43.080
Hello!

20:44.480 --> 20:44.960
Rapid!

20:45.480 --> 20:45.960
Rapid!

20:46.200 --> 20:48.080
[Music intensifies]

20:54.080 --> 20:55.600
- I dont know what you'll do
- Sir

20:55.720 --> 20:56.320
Are you okay?

20:56.480 --> 20:58.080
- Who are you?
- Interview.

20:58.480 --> 20:59.320
Come in.

21:00.480 --> 21:01.320
Chandru.

21:04.840 --> 21:05.480
What's your name?

21:06.200 --> 21:07.080
Sir...

21:07.600 --> 21:08.320
Michael.

21:11.080 --> 21:14.080
Chandru, I'll be on online, you check...

21:15.480 --> 21:16.080
Sorry.

21:17.600 --> 21:21.200
Chandru, you please check with your boss
and let me now

21:21.480 --> 21:24.960
I want the consigment, today at any cost.
Please chandru.

21:27.080 --> 21:28.479
Is there anything else you
know besides this?

21:28.480 --> 21:30.839
Sir! I know. Just tell me
what you want from me.

21:30.840 --> 21:32.080
Go on, do fifty push-ups.

21:33.840 --> 21:34.840
Chandru, did you check?

21:37.960 --> 21:38.720
Please, chandru...

21:39.200 --> 21:40.199
I'm done answering to my boss.

21:40.200 --> 21:41.480
The same thing over and over chandru.

21:44.960 --> 21:45.960
Where did this guy go?

21:48.840 --> 21:51.840
Hey! what are you doing?

21:52.320 --> 21:54.600
Sir! If you’re done with the call...
can I get the offer letter?

21:55.720 --> 21:57.840
- Please... just make sure you don’t cut my job.
- Sure.

21:58.080 --> 22:00.320
[Paperweight swirling]

22:00.720 --> 22:01.080
Boss!

22:02.320 --> 22:05.319
Please check the scores of our
top 4 candidates.

22:05.320 --> 22:07.840
[Paper rustling]

22:08.080 --> 22:09.320
Gutham minus one!

22:09.480 --> 22:10.480
Mani Five!

22:10.600 --> 22:11.840
Balaji minus three!

22:12.480 --> 22:13.320
Michael three!

22:14.600 --> 22:16.840
What, Sadashivam?
Looks like your wallet balance.

22:17.480 --> 22:18.200
Boss...

22:18.720 --> 22:21.720
I’ve created a new marking system...
only for this interview.

22:21.960 --> 22:24.199
- You know how smart i am.
- Yeah.

22:24.200 --> 22:26.720
I’ve known your smartness...
ever since college.

22:26.960 --> 22:27.480
Sir.

22:27.840 --> 22:30.960
You know how things have changed lately...
it’s hard to find someone for sales.

22:31.080 --> 22:32.720
Everyone likes for working in air conditional...

22:32.840 --> 22:33.719
Call centres...

22:33.720 --> 22:37.199
Right it’s 2023. People don’t even know
what MRE's are.

22:37.200 --> 22:37.720
Yeah.

22:37.840 --> 22:40.840
And the package we’re offering...
ten thousand rupees.

22:41.080 --> 22:44.480
Sir... in ten thousand this
is the best we can afford.

22:44.720 --> 22:46.960
Bangalore was number one for
the last five years.

22:47.320 --> 22:48.480
But we dipped to number two

22:49.840 --> 22:51.480
See... we've tried everything in
the first quarter.

22:51.720 --> 22:52.480
But nothing worked

22:52.720 --> 22:53.480
That's why...

22:53.840 --> 22:55.960
I'm bringing back the MRE concept.

22:57.200 --> 22:57.840
Okay.

22:58.080 --> 22:59.599
- Let's go ahead with the
appointment letters.

22:59.600 --> 23:00.480
Sure sir.

23:03.320 --> 23:04.200
Hello!

23:04.840 --> 23:05.480
Is this Mani?

23:05.840 --> 23:06.480
Yes, madam.

23:07.600 --> 23:10.320
Hi this is HR calling from Rapid.

23:10.600 --> 23:12.320
Congratulations you’re selected.

23:12.840 --> 23:16.200
Can you come to the office before 6 PM
and collect your appointment letter?

23:16.480 --> 23:16.960
Yes madam.

23:18.320 --> 23:18.840
Five Minutes...

23:19.720 --> 23:20.080
I come.

23:21.080 --> 23:21.600
Great!

23:21.960 --> 23:22.960
I'll see you then.

23:25.600 --> 23:28.600
[Footsteps approaching]

23:29.200 --> 23:30.840
HR call... selected.

23:30.960 --> 23:31.840
Ask me come in.

23:32.080 --> 23:33.960
Okay... please wait.

23:34.200 --> 23:34.960
I'll inform

23:35.600 --> 23:36.199
Have a seat.

23:36.200 --> 23:37.960
Can you come to the office... before 6 PM?

23:38.080 --> 23:38.719
[Phone Ringing]

23:38.720 --> 23:39.480
Good... thank you.

23:42.600 --> 23:43.080
Hello.

23:44.840 --> 23:45.840
He’s... already here?

23:47.600 --> 23:50.200
Ask him to wait... at the reception.
i'll just come there in five minutes.

23:50.600 --> 23:50.960
Okay!

23:52.320 --> 23:53.840
[Footsteps approaching]

23:54.200 --> 23:55.080
Mr Mani!

23:57.080 --> 23:58.080
That was quick.

23:58.480 --> 23:59.840
You stay close by?

24:01.600 --> 24:03.600
Do you... live close to the office?

24:03.840 --> 24:04.320
No mam

24:04.720 --> 24:06.320
Friend room distance.

24:06.840 --> 24:08.840
I stay tea shop after interview.

24:09.600 --> 24:09.960
Okay.

24:11.200 --> 24:12.600
This is your appointment letter.

24:12.840 --> 24:14.320
There are two sets in this.

24:14.720 --> 24:17.720
Please go through it,
and return one signed copy as acceptance.

24:18.080 --> 24:20.480
[Romantic music playing]

24:27.080 --> 24:28.199
What’s the urgency?

24:28.200 --> 24:29.480
Please read through it... and then sign.

24:29.600 --> 24:31.600
Yes... it's ok madam.

24:33.960 --> 24:34.320
Crazy...

24:37.320 --> 24:38.080
There you go...

24:38.960 --> 24:39.840
All the best.

24:40.200 --> 24:41.200
Welcome to 'Rapid'.

24:41.320 --> 24:42.480
Thank you, Lot many.

24:45.320 --> 24:47.080
[Phone Ringing | Birds Chirping]

24:52.840 --> 24:53.480
Hello.

24:53.600 --> 24:54.960
Mom I got the job.

24:55.200 --> 24:56.839
I’m happy for you... mani.

24:56.840 --> 25:02.320
Market Research Executive... at
'Rapid Access Technologies'.

25:02.600 --> 25:03.960
Please eat on time.

25:05.080 --> 25:06.840
Try not to... stay out too
long under the sun.

25:07.080 --> 25:08.480
My real work... is wandering
under the sun

25:09.200 --> 25:09.720
Okay Mom.

25:10.080 --> 25:11.320
[Vehicles honking]

25:13.200 --> 25:14.200
[Vehicle receding]

25:16.840 --> 25:18.880
[Playful music playing]

25:20.600 --> 25:21.200
Sorry sir.

25:22.840 --> 25:24.720
Straight, left... Conference room.

25:25.840 --> 25:27.480
[Footsteps receding]

25:29.720 --> 25:31.319
Welcome to 'Rapid Access Technologies'.

25:31.320 --> 25:32.720
We are a six-hundred-crore company.

25:34.840 --> 25:36.959
Sir... i was brushing my teeth,
i was coming... and then i got late,

25:36.960 --> 25:39.080
Took my bike... and i was riding
as fast as possible,

25:39.200 --> 25:40.079
And there was this car...

25:40.080 --> 25:41.960
You know Bangalore traffic, right?
And I... accidentally hit this car.

25:42.200 --> 25:44.079
And this man got out of the car...
and called the cops.

25:44.080 --> 25:46.079
And you know what... Cops
took me to the police station

25:46.080 --> 25:47.839
And i tired to negotiate as much
as possible with them

25:47.840 --> 25:50.720
I told them, so many times.
Please, I have to go. I have a meeting, but...

25:51.720 --> 25:52.720
Did i ask you anything?

25:55.600 --> 25:56.200
Sorry sir.

25:56.720 --> 25:58.840
[Footsteps approaching |Chair Squeaking]

26:02.600 --> 26:05.600
You guys should, learn from delivery guys
to be faster.

26:08.320 --> 26:09.480
And where’s your tie?

26:10.720 --> 26:12.600
Sorry sir, forgot.

26:13.320 --> 26:15.199
- Sorry sir.
- Tie is a must for everybody.

26:15.200 --> 26:16.840
If i don't see you without the tie.

26:17.080 --> 26:17.960
I’ll throw you out!

26:18.720 --> 26:18.960
Look!

26:19.720 --> 26:21.840
We’ve hired you on a temporary basis.

26:21.960 --> 26:23.480
Your are here only for six months.

26:23.720 --> 26:24.960
Only if you perform better.

26:25.200 --> 26:27.080
We’ll take you as a 'Sales Executive'.

26:27.200 --> 26:29.240
[Playful music intensifies]

26:32.960 --> 26:35.479
As we’ve divided Bangalore
into four territories.

26:35.480 --> 26:37.840
Your territories list will reach
you by tomorrow morning.

26:38.080 --> 26:39.479
But the most important thing,

26:39.480 --> 26:42.480
Each of you... should work only
in your assigned territory.

26:43.080 --> 26:44.480
If you step into any other territory.

26:44.600 --> 26:46.480
You’ll be terminated immediately!

26:47.080 --> 26:47.480
Okay!

26:48.200 --> 26:50.079
And every morning, when you
come to the office.

26:50.080 --> 26:52.600
You’ll sign the attendance... at sharp 9:30.

26:53.200 --> 26:54.720
You’ll go and comb your territory.

26:55.960 --> 26:56.480
Comb?

26:56.840 --> 26:57.720
Not that 'comb'.

26:57.960 --> 27:00.480
I mean, you’ll have to sweep your territory.

27:03.720 --> 27:03.960
Okay.

27:04.200 --> 27:04.600
Listen.

27:04.720 --> 27:07.480
Every day, your target is to make thirty calls.

27:09.200 --> 27:11.600
And by calls, I mean... face to face.

27:12.600 --> 27:13.080
And not...

27:14.080 --> 27:14.720
Over the phone.

27:17.320 --> 27:20.599
And once you make cold calls...
For the whole week.

27:20.600 --> 27:21.840
You’ll have a big funnel

27:28.320 --> 27:30.600
Have you... ever heard of 'ODPEC'?

27:31.480 --> 27:32.200
'AIDA'?

27:32.960 --> 27:33.480
'SPANCO'?

27:34.960 --> 27:35.600
I’ll... explain.

27:35.840 --> 27:37.880
[Playful music Continues]

27:40.600 --> 27:42.320
- ODPEC!
- What is he writing down?

27:43.840 --> 27:44.320
'O'

27:44.840 --> 27:45.600
Open the Sale!

27:46.480 --> 27:46.960
'D'

27:47.080 --> 27:48.200
You Develop the sale!

27:49.840 --> 27:50.200
'P'

27:50.320 --> 27:51.960
You’ll Propose the solutions
to the client.

27:53.600 --> 27:53.840
'E'

27:54.200 --> 27:56.600
You'll Eliminate all the client's doubts.

27:58.840 --> 27:59.479
And Finally.

27:59.480 --> 27:59.840
'C'

28:00.200 --> 28:01.320
You'll Close the deal.

28:04.600 --> 28:06.600
You'll only deal with 'O' and 'D'

28:06.720 --> 28:09.599
After that you will hand it over
to the telemarketing team.

28:09.600 --> 28:10.599
I want you to understand...

28:10.600 --> 28:12.720
Because in six months, if you
become a Sales Executive...

28:13.320 --> 28:14.320
This will be helpful.

28:14.600 --> 28:14.959
Right!

28:14.960 --> 28:15.960
[Door opens slowly]

28:16.080 --> 28:17.200
- Sir!
- This can be.

28:17.840 --> 28:18.080
Yeah!

28:18.200 --> 28:20.480
The candidate for the servicing team,
is waiting for half an hour

28:20.600 --> 28:20.840
I'll come.

28:21.080 --> 28:21.200
Yeah.

28:23.720 --> 28:24.840
[Cars honking]

28:26.480 --> 28:27.480
[Footsteps Approaching]

28:27.840 --> 28:28.960
Hey guys!

28:30.840 --> 28:32.840
So... Gopinath sir has been
held up somewhere.

28:32.960 --> 28:34.959
He asked you all to watch a movie...

28:34.960 --> 28:36.480
That'll help you guys in the field.

28:41.640 --> 28:43.520
[Playful music intensifies]

28:45.200 --> 28:46.320
Enjoy the movie... guys.

29:11.600 --> 29:13.240
[Footsteps receding]

29:17.600 --> 29:18.960
[Door opens]

29:19.200 --> 29:20.080
Hi MRE's

29:20.960 --> 29:21.840
How was the film?

29:22.080 --> 29:26.080
MRE's - Super sir 100 days, Super Sir.

29:27.480 --> 29:29.080
Once again we wish you all the best.

29:29.480 --> 29:31.320
Please collect your on the
job essentials from HR.

29:31.480 --> 29:33.320
MRE's - Thank you sir, Thank you sir,
Thank you sir.

29:33.600 --> 29:35.080
[Slow-moving vehicles]

29:36.320 --> 29:37.840
[Phone ringing | Footstep approaching]

29:43.080 --> 29:44.840
[Phone ringing | Dog barking]

29:46.960 --> 29:47.960
[Phone ringing continues]

29:54.200 --> 29:55.320
- Hello
- Mom...

29:55.480 --> 29:56.960
How are you doing, Mani?

29:57.840 --> 30:00.840
- Are you eating on time?
- I’m yet to eat, mom.

30:02.080 --> 30:02.840
Where’s Dad?

30:03.200 --> 30:04.200
Dad...

30:07.480 --> 30:09.320
He’s watching TV.

30:09.480 --> 30:10.080
My sister?

30:10.320 --> 30:10.960
What's she doing?

30:11.320 --> 30:13.200
She is inside, studying.

30:13.480 --> 30:15.720
- Do you want to talk to her?
- No, mom give it to Dad.

30:16.200 --> 30:16.960
Dad...

30:17.320 --> 30:19.000
[Somber music playing]

30:20.960 --> 30:21.600
Dad...

30:21.960 --> 30:23.320
He just went out.

30:24.600 --> 30:25.080
Mom.

30:26.080 --> 30:26.960
What happened?

30:27.320 --> 30:28.960
But... just now you said
he was watching TV?

30:29.480 --> 30:30.320
Can you please tell me
what happened?

30:33.480 --> 30:35.960
Nothing serious, Mani.
Dad's just worried about our land.

30:36.480 --> 30:38.600
Some people came from the bank...
to the house.

30:38.720 --> 30:41.080
The loan EMIs... have been
overdue for almost a year.

30:41.480 --> 30:43.319
Dad pleaded...
three months to settle it.

30:43.320 --> 30:46.080
Despite his pleading... they were
very rude to Dad.

30:47.480 --> 30:49.319
It seems... if we don’t clear
within three months.

30:49.320 --> 30:52.200
They’ll auction our land.

30:52.840 --> 30:53.320
Mani!

30:54.080 --> 30:54.960
Can you hear me?

30:55.480 --> 30:56.320
Are you still there?

30:56.720 --> 30:57.480
Can you hear me?

30:57.840 --> 30:58.320
Mani!

30:58.960 --> 30:59.600
Mom.

31:00.600 --> 31:01.520
I’m... still here.

31:02.320 --> 31:03.480
You don't have to worry
about anything, Mom.

31:03.720 --> 31:05.320
I’ll somehow arrange the money.

31:06.960 --> 31:07.840
Please tell Dad about this.

31:09.200 --> 31:11.080
- Okay.
- Bye, Mom.

31:22.080 --> 31:24.600
[Ominous music rises]

31:33.720 --> 31:35.200
[Wrapper rustles| Both laugh]

31:35.320 --> 31:36.319
Too good, right?

31:36.320 --> 31:37.599
Take! Take! Take! Eat and Watch.

31:37.600 --> 31:39.200
Uncle... are the snacks ready?

31:41.840 --> 31:42.640
[Laughter continues]

31:45.480 --> 31:46.080
What?

31:46.480 --> 31:47.720
You guys... watch this too?

31:50.600 --> 31:51.600
Do you know him?

31:52.600 --> 31:53.599
Brother, your parcel is ready.

31:53.600 --> 31:54.200
I’m coming, Uncle!

31:54.720 --> 31:56.200
Has he lost it or something?

31:57.200 --> 31:58.080
Thank you uncle.

32:00.080 --> 32:01.600
- Bye uncle!
- Bye Bye...

32:01.960 --> 32:04.719
Hey... you didn’t take money from him.
Why only us?

32:04.720 --> 32:07.080
All of these properties belong to his father.

32:10.960 --> 32:12.600
You have no idea... how rich his father is.

32:12.720 --> 32:13.480
Listen!

32:14.840 --> 32:15.720
Listen!

32:15.960 --> 32:17.080
- Listen
- Brother?

32:17.320 --> 32:19.480
[Ominous tune rises]

32:22.200 --> 32:23.520
[Footsteps approaching]

32:24.720 --> 32:25.480
Balaji.

32:26.320 --> 32:26.840
Can you please come here?

32:28.480 --> 32:29.200
Sir tell me.

32:29.600 --> 32:30.840
You want something? Sir, tell me!

32:31.200 --> 32:31.960
Sir tell me...

32:32.200 --> 32:33.760
[Playful music playing]

32:35.480 --> 32:37.960
Sir, It is the fourth month in
the Hindu lunar calendar.

32:38.320 --> 32:39.320
If I read your palm during this season...

32:39.480 --> 32:41.480
It will affect your future.

32:42.120 --> 32:44.240
[Playful music continues]

32:46.600 --> 32:48.600
- Okay! you please continue.
- Yes sir.

32:48.960 --> 32:49.480
Balaji!

32:50.200 --> 32:50.719
Oh no, not again.

32:50.720 --> 32:53.200
Don’t hesitate... if you need any help.

32:53.320 --> 32:57.320
Sir, I’ve never seen anyone
as godly as you in this whole world.

32:57.480 --> 33:00.960
Sir... no harm will come to you.
God will always protect you.

33:02.480 --> 33:05.840
Has he gone mad? Always showing
his palm for a reading.

33:10.480 --> 33:12.600
I have no idea why they
hired such maniacs at work.

33:13.080 --> 33:15.839
Oh good! This company looks big.

33:15.840 --> 33:18.480
[Footsteps approaching | Phone ringing]

33:18.720 --> 33:19.080
Hello!

33:19.200 --> 33:20.720
One of our clients is coming from delhi.

33:20.840 --> 33:21.080
Okay!

33:21.200 --> 33:22.320
His name is Gautham

33:22.480 --> 33:23.480
Our boss is stuck in traffic.

33:23.840 --> 33:25.320
Call me once he arrives.

33:25.480 --> 33:27.080
Okay! Martha sure. Thank you, yeah.

33:27.840 --> 33:28.320
[Footsteps approaching]

33:29.080 --> 33:31.080
- Hi, Good morning
- Good morning

33:31.320 --> 33:31.840
I’m Gautam.

33:32.080 --> 33:32.320
From...

33:32.960 --> 33:34.200
Oh... Mr. Gautam.

33:34.320 --> 33:35.720
- Please, have a seat.
- Thank you.

33:35.960 --> 33:37.200
[Playful music playing]

33:38.200 --> 33:38.960
Miss Martha.

33:39.480 --> 33:41.080
- Mr. Gautam is here.
- Okay.

33:41.200 --> 33:42.600
- Thank you.
- Yeah, Welcome.

33:43.200 --> 33:45.480
- By the way what's your name?
- Swapna sir.

33:45.600 --> 33:46.320
- Swapna!
- Yes sir.

33:46.480 --> 33:47.720
- Nice name.
- Thank you.

33:48.320 --> 33:48.840
Hi...

33:49.200 --> 33:49.840
You're Gautam?

33:50.080 --> 33:50.480
Hi... hi.

33:50.600 --> 33:51.959
Hi, Gautam... this is Martha.

33:51.960 --> 33:53.599
- Nice to meet you.
- Same here, same here

33:53.600 --> 33:53.960
Yeah!

33:54.480 --> 33:55.720
- Shall we?
- Yeah

33:56.480 --> 33:59.480
- Sir! Please have a seat
- Thank you... thank you so much.

34:02.080 --> 34:04.080
Would you like to have tea, coffee,
or something ?

34:05.840 --> 34:08.320
- Can i have pepsi?
- Sure.

34:08.600 --> 34:09.200
I'll get it for you.

34:10.600 --> 34:12.200
Honestly... so much respect
for Cold Calling.

34:13.960 --> 34:15.600
[Footsteps approaching]

34:15.720 --> 34:17.320
- Hi Good morning.
- Good morning sir.

34:17.480 --> 34:19.480
Sorry... I got delayed due to traffic.

34:19.720 --> 34:20.320
Hope you don’t mind.

34:20.720 --> 34:21.320
Have a seat.

34:22.480 --> 34:23.080
That’s okay, sir...

34:23.320 --> 34:24.080
I totally understand.

34:24.320 --> 34:25.600
Bangalore traffic is terrible

34:25.720 --> 34:26.360
Oh, really?

34:26.600 --> 34:28.360
Do you visit Bangalore regularly?

34:28.720 --> 34:31.840
Compared to Delhi, Bangalore traffic
isn’t that bad, right?

34:31.960 --> 34:33.960
By the way which part of
Delhi you come from?

34:34.200 --> 34:35.480
Delhi?

34:35.720 --> 34:37.319
Sir! What are you talking.

34:37.320 --> 34:40.320
I’ve never even crossed Silk Board
Junction in my life, sir.

34:42.320 --> 34:44.960
Sorry i didnt get the joke, My bad.

34:45.080 --> 34:45.720
That’s okay, Sir.

34:45.960 --> 34:46.960
I can tell a new one sir.

34:47.200 --> 34:49.200
[Playful music continues]

34:51.200 --> 34:53.960
You are Mr. Gautham Arora.

34:54.320 --> 34:55.960
From Premium industries right?

34:56.200 --> 34:59.840
Sir, I’m Gautam. Who is the other person
with the first name?

35:00.840 --> 35:03.840
- Then who are you?
- Just a moment sir.

35:05.320 --> 35:08.480
- Sir i'm Gautam Bk from Rapid Technologies.
- Rapid Technologies!

35:09.200 --> 35:09.839
Security!

35:09.840 --> 35:10.600
[Bag drops]

35:10.840 --> 35:11.840
Sir—no, sir. No, sir.

35:11.960 --> 35:13.120
[Body thuds to the floor]

35:16.840 --> 35:17.320
Brother...

35:18.080 --> 35:18.960
What, brother...?

35:19.960 --> 35:22.600
[Vehicle engine fades]
- Everything seems so far away.

35:23.600 --> 35:25.200
Watch Properly.

35:25.480 --> 35:26.720
Okay Bro.

35:27.080 --> 35:30.200
- Now i can see clearly...
- What do you see?

35:30.320 --> 35:31.600
I can see a beautiful girl.

35:31.840 --> 35:35.080
Not the girl, you fool!
Look for the boy.

35:35.200 --> 35:38.079
- Brother! I can see him, i can see him
- can you see him?

35:38.080 --> 35:40.320
Look! Look! Look, brother!

35:41.720 --> 35:42.960
- Take this...
- Here Brother take a drag.

35:43.200 --> 35:44.200
Look what is he upto.

35:44.840 --> 35:47.840
He’s the one, brother! Look he’s eating non-stop.

35:49.080 --> 35:52.600
- Brother! Start the vehicle, let’s get going
- Come! Come! Let’s go.

35:53.720 --> 35:55.599
- What are you searching for?
- Uncle where's the mobile?

35:55.600 --> 35:57.200
- I said leave
- Got it, Got it, Got it.

35:57.320 --> 35:58.840
- Your dad will lecture me
if I give you the mobile.

35:58.960 --> 36:01.600
- Dont worry uncle. I won’t tell my dad.
- Ok you get inside the car now.

36:02.320 --> 36:03.960
Come on, follow them! Don’t lose them!

36:05.960 --> 36:07.000
[Footsteps approaching]

36:08.600 --> 36:10.479
[Playful music rising]

36:10.480 --> 36:11.320
What is this guy doing here?

36:13.840 --> 36:14.320
Oh god!

36:14.480 --> 36:15.720
If he sees me here, I’m finished.

36:16.640 --> 36:18.200
[Playful music continues]

36:20.720 --> 36:22.320
What is this fool doing here?

36:22.880 --> 36:24.320
[Footsteps approaching]

36:25.200 --> 36:26.760
[Playful music swells]

36:35.200 --> 36:37.840
Slowly i'll esacpe from here.

36:42.200 --> 36:45.600
- Hi, Hi...
- Oh god! got caught!

36:46.600 --> 36:47.320
Hi Brother!

36:47.600 --> 36:48.720
How come you’re here?

36:49.840 --> 36:50.960
How come you’re here?

36:52.200 --> 36:54.320
- I came here... to meet a client.
- Oh client...

36:54.720 --> 36:58.320
Is your client a kabaddi player or what?
Your pants are all muddy.

36:58.480 --> 36:59.720
No, bro... football player.

37:01.600 --> 37:02.480
Yeah... I can see that all over your face.

37:02.600 --> 37:02.960
Come.

37:03.840 --> 37:04.480
Watch it.

37:05.200 --> 37:05.720
Just like that.

37:07.720 --> 37:08.200
Thank you.

37:10.320 --> 37:12.640
[Birds chirping | Bag hits the floor]

37:16.840 --> 37:17.960
You won’t tell this to the manager... right?

37:20.080 --> 37:21.320
I’m not that sincere, bro.

37:21.480 --> 37:22.600
You’re one of us, bro.

37:23.720 --> 37:24.200
Mad you mean?

37:25.080 --> 37:25.720
No! You’re my buddy, bro.

37:28.080 --> 37:28.960
- Sorry
- That's okay.

37:29.200 --> 37:29.720
That's okay.

37:30.200 --> 37:32.479
[Vehicles honking]

37:32.480 --> 37:35.080
[Footsteps approaching]

37:41.080 --> 37:43.199
Which girl’s dress got caught in the wheel...

37:43.200 --> 37:44.320
And caused this Accident?

37:44.840 --> 37:45.960
Why are you thinking like that?

37:46.200 --> 37:48.480
You were walking smartly, right? That’s why I asked.

37:49.320 --> 37:49.840
I'll tell you.

37:50.080 --> 37:51.320
He slipped... and fell!

37:52.960 --> 37:53.480
I... fell

37:54.600 --> 37:56.199
Oh... so you were the one
who helped him, huh?

37:56.200 --> 37:56.720
Yes... of course.

37:57.200 --> 37:57.960
A true friendship.

37:58.080 --> 38:00.320
So, What were you doing in his territory?

38:00.600 --> 38:01.840
[Mischievous music builds]

38:03.720 --> 38:04.320
It's okay.

38:04.840 --> 38:06.080
I wont tell this to anybody.

38:07.080 --> 38:07.479
Oh Great!

38:07.480 --> 38:09.479
- I was just pulling your leg.
- Thank you.

38:09.480 --> 38:10.080
Gautam!

38:10.720 --> 38:11.720
Shall I get you some medicine?

38:12.200 --> 38:14.319
I have nursed him, well enough...

38:14.320 --> 38:16.200
Will you please come, my beloved brother.

38:38.480 --> 38:41.079
Sir, can I get you coffee or tea?

38:41.080 --> 38:41.720
Hey! Raja.

38:42.200 --> 38:43.480
You... disappeared for three days?

38:43.840 --> 38:45.080
There was no one to serve us coffee.

38:45.320 --> 38:47.599
Sir, I’ve been on leave
for the past three days.

38:47.600 --> 38:48.839
My mother wasn't feeling well.

38:48.840 --> 38:50.199
I had to admit her to the hospital.

38:50.200 --> 38:50.600
Sorry to hear that.

38:50.840 --> 38:51.840
How’s she doing now?

38:51.960 --> 38:53.600
Sir, she’s doing alright now.

38:53.720 --> 38:55.320
She’ll be discharged by
tomorrow morning.

38:55.840 --> 38:57.079
Sir, can I get you coffee or tea?

38:57.080 --> 38:57.720
Raja, come here!

38:58.320 --> 38:59.360
[Footsteps approaching]

39:01.480 --> 39:03.080
[Cash rustling]

39:05.600 --> 39:08.600
Here, There's not much... use it for
mother’s medication.

39:09.080 --> 39:11.480
[Heartwarming music builds]

39:13.240 --> 39:15.200
Sir, I'll get some coffee.

39:18.720 --> 39:19.320
Mani.

39:20.080 --> 39:22.480
You're here because you're
struggling financially.

39:22.960 --> 39:24.720
You gave everything you had.

39:24.960 --> 39:27.960
I’ll manage somehow.

39:28.200 --> 39:31.200
Giving money isn’t such a big deal.

39:31.720 --> 39:33.320
My mother always advised me.

39:33.600 --> 39:35.960
When someone is going through
a financial emergency.

39:36.320 --> 39:38.720
Give them whatever you can manage.

39:38.960 --> 39:41.080
Nine out of ten people...
they’ll definitely take it.

39:41.960 --> 39:44.480
Instead of that, if we formally
ask them if they need any help?

39:44.960 --> 39:48.600
They’ll avoid us by saying,
That’s okay, we’ll manage.

39:48.840 --> 39:51.840
So, giving whatever we can manage...
is always a good 'deed'

39:54.720 --> 39:55.080
Super... brother.

39:57.960 --> 39:58.600
Super... mani.

40:02.720 --> 40:03.840
[Footstep approaching]

40:04.600 --> 40:05.320
You... are great, bro.

40:06.520 --> 40:07.720
[Chair squeaking]

40:12.600 --> 40:15.600
Sorry, sir... Sadashivam sent me
to get some snacks for him.

40:16.200 --> 40:18.840
- I'll bring the coffee.
- That’s... okay, Raja.

40:19.080 --> 40:20.320
We’re going out for snacks anyway.

40:20.720 --> 40:21.720
We’ll have our coffee... there.

40:22.200 --> 40:22.480
Okay

40:23.320 --> 40:24.480
[Cash rustling]

40:25.480 --> 40:26.600
- Here, have this.
- Sir.

40:27.480 --> 40:28.640
[Heartwarming music rises]

40:31.200 --> 40:33.080
May God always bless you.

40:39.960 --> 40:40.600
Oh God!

40:44.720 --> 40:46.720
Okay guys. Let's go for coffee?

40:48.480 --> 40:48.960
Mani.

40:49.320 --> 40:49.960
Coffee?

40:50.320 --> 40:51.480
- Me too?
- Come bro.

40:51.600 --> 40:53.600
<i>♪ No map contains this, Two eyes alone ♪</i>

40:53.720 --> 40:55.599
<i>♪ No map contains this, Two eyes alone ♪</i>

40:55.600 --> 40:59.320
<i>♪ Can't capture this ♪</i>

40:59.600 --> 41:02.080
<i>♪ Even if distance finds us ♪</i>

41:02.200 --> 41:03.720
- Hi bro...
<i>♪ Even if distance finds us ♪</i>

41:03.840 --> 41:05.599
- We all work together
<i>♪ We'll never drift apart ♪</i>

41:05.600 --> 41:07.480
- Hey what you want guys?
<i>♪ We'll never drift apart ♪</i>

41:07.600 --> 41:09.480
<i>♪ Everything's a moment ♪</i>

41:09.720 --> 41:11.599
<i>♪ Yet, we behold it ♪</i>

41:11.600 --> 41:13.599
<i>♪ If we go together ♪</i>

41:13.600 --> 41:15.720
<i>♪ "This journey has no end" ♪</i>

41:32.320 --> 41:35.600
<i>♪ Where does the cold wind go? ♪</i>

41:36.320 --> 41:40.200
<i>♪ Let's search for it ♪</i>

41:40.320 --> 41:43.480
<i>♪ The sky belongs to us ♪</i>

41:44.320 --> 41:46.960
<i>♪ Let's go as far as we dream ♪</i>

41:47.080 --> 41:50.720
<i>♪ We crossed the winding roads together ♪</i>

41:51.080 --> 41:54.080
<i>♪ We forgot time as it melted away ♪</i>

41:55.200 --> 41:58.840
<i>♪ We savored everything our eyes could hold ♪</i>

41:59.080 --> 42:03.840
<i>♪ Hearts flowing wild like waves ♪</i>

43:00.320 --> 43:03.960
<i>♪ Even when the sun rises ♪</i>

43:04.320 --> 43:07.320
<i>♪ Let’s live on as the moon that shines. ♪</i>

43:08.320 --> 43:09.720
<i>♪ This boat is ours ♪</i>

43:10.200 --> 43:11.480
<i>♪ And so is the sea ♪</i>

43:11.600 --> 43:13.319
<i>♪ We become its waves ♪</i>

43:13.320 --> 43:15.480
<i>♪ We become its shore ♪</i>

43:16.320 --> 43:17.600
<i>♪ When every path ♪</i>

43:17.720 --> 43:19.600
<i>♪ Has been travelled ♪</i>

43:20.320 --> 43:23.600
<i>♪ The heart still seeks home ♪</i>

43:24.080 --> 43:25.840
<i>♪ Journeys like these ♪</i>

43:25.960 --> 43:27.719
<i>♪ Has no destination ♪</i>

43:27.720 --> 43:30.720
<i>♪ My companion ♪</i>

43:32.480 --> 43:35.600
<i>♪ Our footsteps touch the shore ♪</i>

43:35.840 --> 43:39.600
<i>♪ We've marked every path we've known ♪</i>

43:39.840 --> 43:42.840
<i>♪ If tomorrow's wave, Comes searching for us ♪</i>

43:43.720 --> 43:47.080
<i>♪ Let's feel its touch upon our hearts ♪</i>

43:47.200 --> 43:50.480
<i>♪ We crossed the winding roads together ♪</i>

43:50.960 --> 43:54.480
<i>♪ We forgot time as it melted away ♪</i>

43:55.080 --> 43:58.320
<i>♪ We savored everything our eyes could hold ♪</i>

43:58.960 --> 44:03.600
<i>♪ Hearts flowing wild like waves ♪</i>

44:20.760 --> 44:22.000
[Music fades]

44:23.480 --> 44:23.840
Brother!

44:24.320 --> 44:25.480
Four cups of tea.

44:25.600 --> 44:26.840
[Footsteps approaching]

44:28.200 --> 44:30.199
Guys, where the hell are you?

44:30.200 --> 44:32.200
Waiting at the tea shop.
The tea is already ordered.

44:32.320 --> 44:33.199
I’m right here... at this shop

44:33.200 --> 44:34.080
[Playful, mischievous music rises]

44:34.480 --> 44:36.960
Boys, Alert! Sadashivam
is here don’t come.

44:37.720 --> 44:38.080
Hey!

44:40.080 --> 44:40.320
Hey!

44:40.720 --> 44:41.480
Come here!

44:41.960 --> 44:43.720
- Sir... you’re calling me?
- Who else is here? Come!

44:43.960 --> 44:45.200
Oh God, looks like he’s sniffed
out something again

44:46.480 --> 44:46.720
Sir.

44:48.840 --> 44:49.640
[Playful, mischievous music swells]

44:50.600 --> 44:50.960
Sir!

44:51.840 --> 44:54.080
Sir, reading your palm before six o'clock
would bring a curse

44:54.960 --> 44:56.960
Take your drama somewhere else,
not with me.

44:57.320 --> 45:00.520
Sir, I promise—tomorrow evening I will read
your palm completely. Trust me.

45:03.520 --> 45:04.720
[Cash rustling]

45:06.200 --> 45:07.600
Get me a cigarette, Now.

45:09.320 --> 45:11.840
Looks like this guy has nothing to do...
what a slacker.

45:14.480 --> 45:15.520
[Engine sputters]

45:16.840 --> 45:17.720
Madam.

45:18.080 --> 45:19.720
Is there something wrong with the bike?
Any issues?

45:19.960 --> 45:21.320
Don't call me madam again.

45:21.480 --> 45:21.960
Sorry...

45:23.080 --> 45:24.959
Why won’t this vehicle start again?

45:24.960 --> 45:26.200
What’s wrong with this thing?

45:26.480 --> 45:28.080
- Step aside. Let me check.
- Yeah.

45:28.200 --> 45:29.480
[Romantic music plays]

45:31.200 --> 45:32.200
Hello...?

45:33.320 --> 45:36.320
Just checking if the bike
has enough fuel.

45:38.080 --> 45:38.760
[Kicking sounds]

45:40.000 --> 45:40.640
[Engine starts]

45:41.080 --> 45:42.080
Oh my god!

45:42.720 --> 45:43.720
Thank you.

45:44.960 --> 45:46.600
- Is everything ok?
- Where are you going?

45:46.960 --> 45:47.960
I'm heading to the bus stand madam.

45:48.320 --> 45:49.600
Sorry... Priyanka.

45:49.840 --> 45:50.600
Come... i will drop you.

45:50.960 --> 45:52.480
- Ey No! that's ok i'll manage
- Come, come.

45:52.600 --> 45:53.200
Okay.

45:55.840 --> 45:56.960
[Engine noise recedes]

45:59.080 --> 45:59.840
[Glass clinks]

46:00.200 --> 46:01.080
Mani what's the time?

46:06.720 --> 46:08.080
Take it slow, bro...

46:08.200 --> 46:09.200
It's getting late.

46:09.320 --> 46:09.960
Time to leave.

46:10.840 --> 46:11.600
What's getting late?

46:12.080 --> 46:12.840
I've work.

46:12.960 --> 46:14.960
- I'll meet you guys in the evening, bye
- Okay Bye, bye

46:15.960 --> 46:16.720
- Mani!
- Wait, wait.

46:17.480 --> 46:18.720
Leave! Let him at least work.

46:19.600 --> 46:20.840
We took this job just to pass the time.

46:21.200 --> 46:22.320
He has responsibilities he can’t ignore.

46:22.600 --> 46:23.720
He doesn't even have a bike to travel

46:23.960 --> 46:25.200
He travels around places by bus.

46:25.840 --> 46:26.320
Sad, right?

46:28.720 --> 46:29.080
Hey! Mani

46:29.320 --> 46:29.600
Come.

46:32.080 --> 46:33.480
Here, take this... keep my bike with you.

46:34.200 --> 46:35.320
I’ll go along with Gautam.

46:36.080 --> 46:36.320
Hey!

46:36.600 --> 46:37.600
You don’t have to do all that.

46:37.840 --> 46:39.080
It’s just a matter of a few days. I’ll manage.

46:39.600 --> 46:41.600
You know Rajesh right? My Roommate.

46:41.720 --> 46:44.480
Even he tried arranging a bike,
yet nothing worked.

46:44.600 --> 46:45.840
I’ve managed to gather some money.

46:45.960 --> 46:49.960
On top of that, I’m expecting some
pending money from the company.

46:50.080 --> 46:52.080
If I manage to get all that money,
I’ll buy a second-hand bike.

46:52.200 --> 46:52.720
Brother.

46:52.960 --> 46:54.720
By the time Sona pays
all that’s incentive money

46:54.840 --> 46:56.600
Definitely, the five hundred rupee note
will be banned.

46:58.080 --> 47:00.599
Let's combine all our savings and
pick up second hand bike.

47:00.600 --> 47:03.200
- No Bro...
- There’s a dealer I know who handles used bikes

47:03.320 --> 47:05.080
He’s great at dealing with seized bikes.

47:05.200 --> 47:06.080
I’ll speak with him.

47:06.200 --> 47:07.720
Don’t expect a perfectly documented bike.

47:07.840 --> 47:10.600
- I don’t think that will be a problem... for now.
- okay.

47:11.080 --> 47:13.320
- Then give him a call and check if he’s around
- You sit!

47:13.480 --> 47:14.720
Take a seat, bro. Sit down.

47:16.960 --> 47:17.600
Greetings brother.

47:17.840 --> 47:18.720
Balaji here.

47:19.320 --> 47:19.719
Brother...

47:19.720 --> 47:21.720
My friend is planning to buy a bike

47:21.840 --> 47:23.480
I thought we’d come to you for the bike.

47:25.320 --> 47:26.080
Yes Brother, today.

47:27.840 --> 47:29.960
Yeah! okay brother okay, done.

47:30.480 --> 47:33.480
It’s nearby — a fifteen-minute ride for us
He’ll get there before us.

47:33.600 --> 47:37.199
[Phone ringing]

47:37.200 --> 47:40.200
Dude! Change your ringtone...
I’m confused who’s getting the call.

47:40.320 --> 47:40.840
Why?

47:41.080 --> 47:41.480
You change it.

47:41.720 --> 47:42.080
You change it.

47:42.480 --> 47:42.840
No, you change it.

47:42.960 --> 47:44.079
I can’t. I’m a big fan of Thalaivar.

47:44.080 --> 47:46.080
- No, you change it.
- No, you change it.

47:48.840 --> 47:50.960
Until the next movie song is released.

47:51.320 --> 47:53.480
Don’t even expect me to change.

47:55.320 --> 47:56.600
[Phone ringing continues]

47:57.320 --> 47:57.960
Phone.

48:00.480 --> 48:01.040
Yeah, Yeah.

48:04.640 --> 48:06.000
[Footsteps approaching | Chair squeaks]

48:06.880 --> 48:10.120
If he's quoting beyond our budget, come back.
We'll find another vehicle.

48:10.240 --> 48:11.640
Bro, chill don’t worry.

48:12.880 --> 48:13.640
Let's go brother.

48:13.880 --> 48:15.120
[Footstep approaching]

48:16.880 --> 48:17.999
Dude... ask him for a Cigarette.

48:18.000 --> 48:18.520
- Cigarette?
- Hmm...

48:18.880 --> 48:20.360
Guys, what shall we plan until they get back?

48:21.360 --> 48:22.239
- Idea!
- What?

48:22.240 --> 48:22.760
Macha!

48:23.120 --> 48:25.760
Why can’t we start our cold calling
from this tea shop?

48:27.000 --> 48:28.000
Shall we try using "WOODPECKER"?

48:29.000 --> 48:30.759
Dude! It’s not Woodpecker — it’s ODPEC

48:30.760 --> 48:32.119
Who cares if it is woodpecker or odpecker

48:32.120 --> 48:32.880
Brother, three teas, please

48:35.360 --> 48:36.120
Come here!

48:36.360 --> 48:37.640
[Footsteps approaching]

48:39.000 --> 48:39.760
Dude... bring us three teas.

48:42.880 --> 48:43.640
[Glass clinks softly]

48:43.880 --> 48:45.639
- No, leave it... it’s here.
- Brother this is ours. We ordered it.

48:45.640 --> 48:47.759
You ordered? So what?
Who gives a damn?!

48:47.760 --> 48:50.520
Order if you want to drink.
Why are you taking ours?

48:50.640 --> 48:52.520
Brother... can you tell them
we ordered first?

48:53.000 --> 48:55.120
Don’t even step in. I’ll handle this.

48:55.360 --> 48:55.760
Give it back.

48:56.000 --> 48:57.880
- Greetings sir... greeting sir.
- Greetings

48:58.000 --> 49:00.239
- How come you came this way?
- You asked for a customer right?

49:00.240 --> 49:01.000
Here they are!

49:01.360 --> 49:03.520
Look, this guy wants tea. Here—take it.

49:04.760 --> 49:06.000
[Tea splashes across his face]

49:12.360 --> 49:13.760
[Fight breaks out | knife clinks]

49:14.000 --> 49:15.520
[Plate shatters]

49:18.640 --> 49:20.120
[Body crashes to the floor | Table overturns]

49:22.360 --> 49:25.360
Guys! Our men are getting beaten... let’s go!

49:25.760 --> 49:27.000
[Chase begins: chaos erupts]

49:31.000 --> 49:32.360
[Footsteps race down the road]

49:41.120 --> 49:42.520
[Rapid footsteps pounding]

49:44.640 --> 49:46.000
[Heavy breathing]

49:46.240 --> 49:47.240
Wait... Wait, Wait...

49:51.120 --> 49:52.360
[Grunting and struggling]

49:53.240 --> 49:53.760
Ah! Was that painful?

49:54.760 --> 49:55.360
That's okay.

49:58.760 --> 50:00.240
They’re here... hurry!

50:02.640 --> 50:04.000
[Bodies crash to the ground]

50:09.880 --> 50:11.360
What... shall we close the deal?

50:11.520 --> 50:14.000
- Is he reliable?
- Dont worry he is my boy.

50:14.120 --> 50:15.760
Let’s settle the deal right away.

50:17.520 --> 50:18.120
- I'll take a leave
- Okay brother.

50:18.520 --> 50:19.520
- Okay brother, okay, okay
- Okay

50:20.000 --> 50:20.880
- Okay, okay

50:21.120 --> 50:22.520
[Music intensifies]

50:36.000 --> 50:36.640
[Body slams against wall]

50:41.640 --> 50:42.120
“Die, you rascal!

50:46.760 --> 50:48.000
[Blows exchanged]

50:51.240 --> 50:52.360
[Body slams against wall]

50:57.360 --> 50:58.640
[Intense music swells]

51:03.120 --> 51:04.880
[Blows exchanged | Bodies scuffle]

51:21.760 --> 51:23.520
[Music fades | Fight subsides]

51:27.880 --> 51:29.640
MRES - Run! Get out of here, you fools!

51:29.760 --> 51:32.359
I was away for five minutes, and look
what you guys got into.

51:32.360 --> 51:34.879
Damn it, they’re the ones who dragged
us into this mess.

51:34.880 --> 51:36.519
I'm sure you guys kicked this off. Otherwise,
why would they?

51:36.520 --> 51:39.000
- Dude! why are scolding us?
- You have no idea how badly they beat us.

51:39.360 --> 51:40.120
How would you know?

51:41.120 --> 51:41.760
Give him the cash!

51:45.240 --> 51:45.880
[Cash rustling]

51:46.880 --> 51:51.240
- Dude, the amount’s less than we agreed.
- Come on, brother adjust this one time please.

51:52.880 --> 51:54.120
[Scooter engine roars | Heroic music plays]

52:16.640 --> 52:19.120
[Snoring]

52:19.760 --> 52:22.240
[Playful music begins]

52:29.240 --> 52:32.240
Oh... sorry, boss, sorry boss.

52:33.000 --> 52:34.120
Boss can you please help me.

52:35.520 --> 52:37.360
I Hired you...
keeping our friendship in mind.

52:37.520 --> 52:40.520
- After this meeting we'll go and check.
- okay done

52:40.640 --> 52:42.239
- Good morning sir.
- We’ll talk later... they’re here.

52:42.240 --> 52:43.000
Good morning!

52:46.360 --> 52:47.520
[Bag thuds on the table]

52:50.880 --> 52:52.640
Exactly. I was wondering—
how come she’s still not here?

52:52.760 --> 52:55.120
Sir, could you sign here, please?

52:55.760 --> 52:56.999
Can we do it in the break?

52:57.000 --> 52:57.640
Yeah!

52:57.880 --> 52:58.880
Okay sir.

53:06.880 --> 53:07.240
What?

53:09.640 --> 53:10.120
#$%#

53:11.240 --> 53:12.880
What kind of #$%# numbers are these?

53:13.000 --> 53:15.760
With numbers like these, how do we convince
head office we’re number one?

53:16.520 --> 53:20.000
He literally grilled me in front of
all the branch managers.

53:22.760 --> 53:23.000
Team!

53:24.240 --> 53:27.640
Bangalore has seen an increase of only 6%
in the last three months.

53:27.880 --> 53:30.240
Whereas the average demand
has increased by 14%.

53:30.640 --> 53:31.760
How are you even getting the orders?

53:31.880 --> 53:33.360
We hired MREs right?

53:33.640 --> 53:34.880
Are you using them effciently?

53:35.120 --> 53:35.640
Boss!

53:35.880 --> 53:37.760
They are of no use.

53:38.120 --> 53:38.760
How about you?

53:39.360 --> 53:41.120
You're sleeping at the office hours.

53:41.520 --> 53:43.760
You could’ve at least
checked their reports, right?

53:44.240 --> 53:46.000
Boss... you’re commenting
without checking the reports.

53:46.120 --> 53:49.120
- All the reports are up to date... until today.
- You want see once?

53:49.640 --> 53:51.759
I managed to look at your MRES report
while I was traveling.

53:51.760 --> 53:52.640
You check it yourself.

53:56.240 --> 53:58.000
You're beloved MRE, Michael.

53:58.640 --> 53:59.240
First august.

54:00.000 --> 54:00.520
Thirty five

54:00.760 --> 54:01.520
August second.

54:02.120 --> 54:02.520
Thirty Eight.

54:02.760 --> 54:03.360
August Third

54:03.520 --> 54:04.120
Thirty Four.

54:04.360 --> 54:05.520
August Fourth! Thirty Six

54:05.760 --> 54:06.880
August Fifth! Thirty Two

54:07.360 --> 54:08.520
Now, watch the magic happen.

54:09.000 --> 54:10.120
Abracadabra!

54:11.640 --> 54:12.240
Week four.

54:12.640 --> 54:14.639
You rascal!

54:14.640 --> 54:16.640
At least you could’ve used your brain
to change the numbers.

54:16.880 --> 54:18.120
Week two, week three—same.

54:18.360 --> 54:21.120
For the past two months, he’s done
nothing but copy and paste.

54:22.120 --> 54:22.880
- Sir
- Hey!

54:23.640 --> 54:25.360
Even I was nothing but a ‘salesman’ earlier.

54:25.640 --> 54:27.240
You need to have some smartness to bluff.

54:28.120 --> 54:29.120
Sir... may i come in?

54:29.640 --> 54:30.000
Sir!

54:30.520 --> 54:31.640
Can I get some coffee or tea?

54:31.760 --> 54:33.000
And some snacks too...

54:34.240 --> 54:34.760
Slightly...

54:35.000 --> 54:36.120
Hungry.

54:43.120 --> 54:44.360
It’s okay to make mistakes.

54:45.000 --> 54:48.000
But what you learn from those
mistakes are very important.

54:48.520 --> 54:48.880
So!

54:49.640 --> 54:50.760
Starting from tomorrow.

54:51.000 --> 54:52.120
All the Four MREs

54:52.520 --> 54:55.240
Should follow Manmeet and Sadashivam
for a couple of days.

54:55.760 --> 54:56.120
Okay!

54:56.880 --> 54:59.120
Learn as much as you guys can from these two.

55:00.120 --> 55:01.120
And i'm serious!

55:01.240 --> 55:03.520
- I really mean it. I’m serious.
- Yes sir.

55:03.640 --> 55:05.640
This time i want to see some
solid prospects.

55:06.240 --> 55:08.640
I want you to win, sincerely and honestly.

55:10.000 --> 55:11.520
- You understand!
- Yes sir!

55:11.760 --> 55:13.120
[Vehicle approaches]

55:16.520 --> 55:19.000
- You both wait here... I’ll be back.
- Okay sir

55:19.640 --> 55:21.000
[Door thuds]

55:21.520 --> 55:22.120
Brother.

55:22.760 --> 55:23.520
- Tell me
- Hello.

55:24.120 --> 55:24.760
What do you want?

55:25.520 --> 55:27.520
- We are Market Research Executive
- Are you salesmen?

55:28.360 --> 55:28.880
Yes!

55:29.000 --> 55:29.640
What do you want from me?

55:29.760 --> 55:30.640
[Quirky suspense music plays]

55:32.120 --> 55:35.239
I see salesmen like you every day.

55:35.240 --> 55:38.240
The building manager comes early.
Talk to him.

55:38.640 --> 55:40.879
Is there a way for us to meet them?

55:40.880 --> 55:42.879
I'm tired of telling the same thing
everyday

55:42.880 --> 55:44.999
I told you—he’ll come in the morning.
Talk to him.

55:45.000 --> 55:47.759
Sir can we get their name and number?

55:47.760 --> 55:49.239
Guys why are you torturing me?

55:49.240 --> 55:51.640
He'll come in the morning
please speak to him.

55:51.880 --> 55:53.760
Michael, have you got the
visiting card with you?

55:56.000 --> 55:56.880
- Sir, sir
- Brother.

55:57.120 --> 55:57.640
Sir!

55:58.520 --> 56:00.880
Keep this with you. and please give it
to the manager

56:01.000 --> 56:02.760
We’ll meet you tomorrow morning.

56:02.880 --> 56:04.640
I have this card already with me.

56:04.880 --> 56:06.240
You already have?

56:06.760 --> 56:07.000
Brother.

56:07.640 --> 56:09.520
How come you have this?
This is the first time we’re coming here.

56:09.640 --> 56:10.640
Don’t believe me? Check it yourself.

56:12.520 --> 56:13.520
[Both burst out laughing]

56:16.360 --> 56:20.240
Looks like this guy is lost. It’s been more than
fifteen minutes since he disappeared.

56:22.240 --> 56:23.000
Call him and find out.

56:23.760 --> 56:24.640
Should i?

56:26.360 --> 56:28.520
No point calling—he left his phone behind.

56:28.760 --> 56:30.760
This is what he always does.

56:32.640 --> 56:33.520
Should we go look for him?

56:34.640 --> 56:35.000
Ok come.

56:35.520 --> 56:37.000
[Suspenseful music swells]

56:38.360 --> 56:39.240
- Bro
- What?

56:41.240 --> 56:42.000
Look over there?

56:42.640 --> 56:43.760
Look at what he’s doing.”

56:43.880 --> 56:45.359
What sort of person drinks at this hour?

56:45.360 --> 56:46.240
Without inviting us.

56:47.000 --> 56:47.760
[Lights cigarette]

56:51.240 --> 56:52.000
- Oh god! he saw us
- Come, come.

56:54.000 --> 56:55.120
[Door slams]

57:01.360 --> 57:02.520
They've switched spots...

57:06.880 --> 57:07.640
[Door slams]

57:11.880 --> 57:12.880
This incident...

57:13.640 --> 57:15.120
Shouldn’t leave the car.

57:16.120 --> 57:17.360
- Okay sir, Okay sir.

57:17.520 --> 57:21.880
- Sir, wow! You’re really fast... faster than light.
- What?

57:22.640 --> 57:23.880
- You're great sir.
- Let's go.

57:24.000 --> 57:26.120
The person we met just now,
told us that...

57:26.760 --> 57:28.640
You’ve already met him earlier
and given him your card.

57:29.120 --> 57:30.879
And it is being used properly, sir.

57:30.880 --> 57:33.120
Once the building is complete,
they’ll definitely call you.

57:33.240 --> 57:35.240
- That's how you do a "COLD CALL
- Yeah totally sir.

57:35.880 --> 57:36.360
That!

57:36.760 --> 57:37.760
Is my gift to you.

57:37.880 --> 57:38.240
MREs- Okay sir, Thank you sir
- Yeah!

57:38.360 --> 57:40.000
No... Not necessary simply why.

57:44.120 --> 57:45.000
[ Footsteps approaching]

57:46.000 --> 57:49.759
- Dude! So this is place where we start our cold call.
- Super right.

57:49.760 --> 57:51.240
Come let's have our lunch first.

57:51.520 --> 57:51.880
Sir.

57:52.240 --> 57:55.359
Why so early, It's just been 11:30,
i'm not hungry.

57:55.360 --> 57:57.359
- Come, let’s grab something light to eat.
- Come bro, let's go.

57:57.360 --> 57:58.120
Sir! sir! sir.

57:58.880 --> 58:00.520
We could have parked the car here, right?

58:00.760 --> 58:03.639
I know what I’m doing.
You come.

58:03.640 --> 58:04.760
He’s a bloody crook.

58:05.640 --> 58:07.240
Sir, you’re absolutely brilliant.

58:08.760 --> 58:10.360
[Footsteps approaching]

58:13.760 --> 58:14.520
Hi sir.

58:15.120 --> 58:17.520
Get me the usual ones
and ask them what they’d like

58:18.120 --> 58:18.640
Menu!

58:19.000 --> 58:19.880
[Playful music plays]

58:21.240 --> 58:21.520
Sir...

58:21.760 --> 58:23.000
Two chicken biryani, sir.

58:23.640 --> 58:24.000
Hey!

58:24.640 --> 58:26.000
But you said you weren’t hungry

58:26.120 --> 58:27.640
Sir... we’ll share and eat.

58:29.120 --> 58:29.520
Okay.

58:29.880 --> 58:30.520
Serve what they ask.

58:30.760 --> 58:32.120
One Fish kebab.

58:32.240 --> 58:33.520
One chicken tikka.

58:33.760 --> 58:35.120
- One andhra style chilly chicken.
- Okay

58:36.240 --> 58:36.880
Is that all for now, sir?

58:37.640 --> 58:38.360
Okay sir i'll get it.

58:38.520 --> 58:39.000
Okay right.

58:40.760 --> 58:41.360
Okay!

58:42.520 --> 58:44.360
Have you ever been to a hotel like this?

58:45.120 --> 58:46.000
MREs- No sir.

58:47.000 --> 58:48.120
Take pride.

58:49.000 --> 58:50.360
You guys are really fortunate.

58:51.000 --> 58:53.760
That too sitting equally with me.

58:54.000 --> 58:54.640
Is a big thing in your lives.

58:55.520 --> 58:57.760
All of this treatment is
purely due to Gopinath

58:58.000 --> 58:58.640
You guys understand right?

59:00.240 --> 59:01.240
MREs- Thanks you sir.

59:04.520 --> 59:06.240
[ Playful music swells]

59:16.360 --> 59:17.640
- Sir your bill.
- Thank you.

59:21.000 --> 59:22.120
Give the card, I'll be back in a minute.

59:23.360 --> 59:25.360
[Playful music intesifies]

59:30.240 --> 59:32.240
- He's trying to tax us.
- Do you have the card?

59:33.520 --> 59:34.240
[Check hits the table]

59:39.240 --> 59:40.360
Looks like, they forgot to tip you, huh?

59:40.520 --> 59:42.360
- They haven't even paid the bill sir.
- What?

59:47.000 --> 59:47.640
Bloody scoundrels!

59:47.880 --> 59:49.360
I'll take care of you later.

59:55.760 --> 59:57.000
Here’s the card.
I’ll pick it up at the counter.

59:57.520 --> 59:58.000
Okay sir.

01:00:00.360 --> 01:00:00.880
Come! let's go!

01:00:01.240 --> 01:00:01.879
Okay sir.

01:00:01.880 --> 01:00:03.240
[Vehicle approaches | tires screech lightly]

01:00:06.880 --> 01:00:07.240
Okay!

01:00:07.760 --> 01:00:10.520
Before the call, let me take a power nap.

01:00:11.360 --> 01:00:12.880
Don't you dare step out!

01:00:13.360 --> 01:00:13.880
Okay sir.

01:00:14.120 --> 01:00:15.240
[Door opens]

01:00:15.520 --> 01:00:16.000
Hey!

01:00:16.640 --> 01:00:19.640
You want incentives?
Then shut the door.

01:00:19.880 --> 01:00:21.000
[Door closes]

01:00:21.640 --> 01:00:22.360
[Seat slides back]

01:00:24.000 --> 01:00:24.760
Mad fellow.

01:00:28.880 --> 01:00:29.640
Mad fellow.

01:00:30.640 --> 01:00:31.120
Is he alive?

01:00:32.520 --> 01:00:33.520
[Snoring]

01:00:34.640 --> 01:00:35.880
[Phone ringing]

01:00:38.360 --> 01:00:38.760
Boss!

01:00:40.000 --> 01:00:40.520
- Boss!
- Sir!

01:00:41.000 --> 01:00:41.640
- Boss!
- Sir!

01:00:42.360 --> 01:00:43.000
Your boss.

01:00:43.640 --> 01:00:44.640
[Phone ringing continues]

01:00:47.640 --> 01:00:48.000
Boss!

01:00:48.240 --> 01:00:48.760
Hey! Rascal.

01:00:48.880 --> 01:00:49.640
Which area are you sleeping?

01:00:49.880 --> 01:00:50.240
[Both burst out laughing]

01:00:50.640 --> 01:00:51.000
Boss!

01:00:51.360 --> 01:00:52.359
This is not the time for jokes!

01:00:52.360 --> 01:00:55.360
I’m putting the boys through intense training.

01:00:56.360 --> 01:00:59.240
Why are you lying at the cost of fuel?

01:00:59.360 --> 01:01:02.760
Shut your mouth and the engine,
and teach them something!

01:01:03.360 --> 01:01:03.760
Boss!

01:01:04.120 --> 01:01:06.360
I'll come to office and discuss this with you.

01:01:06.520 --> 01:01:07.759
I'm at the traffic now.

01:01:07.760 --> 01:01:09.000
Dont get back to sleep.

01:01:14.120 --> 01:01:14.519
Sir.

01:01:14.520 --> 01:01:15.879
Make sure you take notes.

01:01:15.880 --> 01:01:16.999
Time to dive into 'Cold Calling'.

01:01:17.000 --> 01:01:17.760
MREs- Okay sir.

01:01:21.120 --> 01:01:21.520
Mani...

01:01:22.120 --> 01:01:22.520
Sir...

01:01:22.640 --> 01:01:23.880
I'll wait here...

01:01:24.120 --> 01:01:26.240
And watch. How you bypass the gatekeeper...
without an appointment?

01:01:27.000 --> 01:01:28.520
Balaji you wait and watch!

01:01:28.760 --> 01:01:29.360
[Door opens]

01:01:32.760 --> 01:01:33.240
[Door slams]

01:01:33.640 --> 01:01:34.520
[Footsteps approaching]

01:01:42.760 --> 01:01:43.120
Brother!

01:01:43.880 --> 01:01:44.360
Brother!

01:01:47.760 --> 01:01:48.760
[Vehicle approaching | Vehicle honking ]

01:01:52.760 --> 01:01:53.240
[Door slams]

01:01:54.640 --> 01:01:55.360
[Gate creaks open]

01:01:57.880 --> 01:01:58.240
Sir!

01:01:59.880 --> 01:02:00.640
Sorry sir! Sorry sir.

01:02:00.760 --> 01:02:02.240
Why aren’t you at the entrance?
Where have you gone?

01:02:02.880 --> 01:02:03.640
And who are you man?

01:02:03.880 --> 01:02:04.360
Why are you here?

01:02:04.880 --> 01:02:05.880
Sir! MRE.

01:02:06.640 --> 01:02:07.360
Hey! go, go.

01:02:08.120 --> 01:02:08.640
What the hell!

01:02:09.880 --> 01:02:10.240
Get lost!

01:02:12.360 --> 01:02:14.760
[Tense music builds]

01:02:18.000 --> 01:02:20.360
[Heavy gate creaks shut]

01:02:26.520 --> 01:02:28.880
[Vehicle approaching | Door slides open slowly]

01:02:33.880 --> 01:02:36.240
[Tense music ends]

01:02:37.240 --> 01:02:38.880
You’ve got only five minutes.

01:02:39.880 --> 01:02:41.360
Who are those people from the vehicle?

01:02:41.520 --> 01:02:43.240
How are you related to them?

01:02:43.640 --> 01:02:44.000
Sir...

01:02:44.760 --> 01:02:46.880
I’ve told you everything I know.

01:02:47.240 --> 01:02:48.240
Please leave me...

01:02:48.640 --> 01:02:49.640
There’s only one thing.

01:02:50.000 --> 01:02:52.640
I’ve been holding back
for a long time, sir.

01:02:53.360 --> 01:02:54.000
Sir.

01:02:54.520 --> 01:02:55.240
Did you notice his arrogance, sir?

01:02:55.520 --> 01:02:56.240
After such intense interrogation.

01:02:56.520 --> 01:02:57.760
He's not revealing it to you, sir.

01:02:58.120 --> 01:03:00.120
How dare he hide from you?

01:03:00.240 --> 01:03:01.640
He’s still refusing to reveal
it to you as well.

01:03:02.000 --> 01:03:03.880
Then looks like we’re
dealing with big players.

01:03:04.120 --> 01:03:06.360
Let’s hand him over to ‘RBI’, sir.

01:03:10.120 --> 01:03:12.240
Tell me what you’ve been holding back.

01:03:12.360 --> 01:03:12.880
Sir...

01:03:13.760 --> 01:03:15.880
This is what I’ve been holding back, sir.

01:03:21.520 --> 01:03:22.240
Please sir!

01:03:22.560 --> 01:03:25.399
[Birds chirping softly | Footsteps approach]

01:03:25.400 --> 01:03:26.000
Oh God!

01:03:26.640 --> 01:03:27.000
This guy...

01:03:27.400 --> 01:03:28.800
[Playful music playing]

01:03:31.400 --> 01:03:31.880
Stupid...

01:03:32.160 --> 01:03:32.760
Wasted a cigarette.

01:03:33.000 --> 01:03:33.760
Good.

01:03:33.880 --> 01:03:36.640
The smoke you blow out... is ruining my lungs

01:03:37.160 --> 01:03:38.280
Please... leave this habit.

01:03:38.520 --> 01:03:39.760
I left it, so it fell.

01:03:41.000 --> 01:03:42.520
That's good... bad joke!

01:03:42.640 --> 01:03:44.400
Dude! Why are you always advising?

01:03:44.640 --> 01:03:45.000
Okay come...

01:03:45.520 --> 01:03:47.160
Before someone else show up...

01:03:47.280 --> 01:03:48.400
We’ll move to some other joint.

01:03:48.760 --> 01:03:50.640
Hey! Who cares if someone shows up.

01:03:50.760 --> 01:03:52.160
- We'll handle them!
- What?

01:03:52.280 --> 01:03:53.880
Your body language... something’s
not right.

01:03:54.880 --> 01:03:55.880
Even after encountering Sadashivam...

01:03:56.160 --> 01:03:57.279
You were calm... and composed.

01:03:57.280 --> 01:03:58.160
But him...

01:03:59.000 --> 01:04:00.280
He got scared when he saw you.

01:04:00.400 --> 01:04:01.160
Hey! nothing like that.

01:04:01.520 --> 01:04:04.520
What did you two do to him yesterday?

01:04:07.000 --> 01:04:08.520
He’s... one nasty guy.

01:04:09.000 --> 01:04:10.640
I don’t know what urgency he had.

01:04:11.160 --> 01:04:13.280
But his body language... didn’t seem urgent.

01:04:13.640 --> 01:04:15.000
You guys are hiding something from us.

01:04:15.760 --> 01:04:17.400
Dude! There’s nothing like what you guys think.

01:04:18.280 --> 01:04:20.639
After finishing the call, we were
heading back in his car...

01:04:20.640 --> 01:04:21.280
While you were coming...?

01:04:22.880 --> 01:04:23.400
[Vehicle approaching]
Hey, hey, hey...

01:04:24.920 --> 01:04:26.440
Are you blind... do you think
this is your father’s road?

01:04:29.400 --> 01:04:30.880
Watch out, you stupid!

01:04:32.280 --> 01:04:33.000
Have you lost it?

01:04:33.160 --> 01:04:33.640
You’re blocking my way.

01:04:36.640 --> 01:04:37.920
[Ominous score fades in]

01:04:39.760 --> 01:04:41.200
[Paan splatters on windshield]

01:04:43.560 --> 01:04:44.000
[Door opens]

01:04:45.200 --> 01:04:45.520
[Door slams]

01:04:46.520 --> 01:04:47.680
[Fight music intensifies | Glass shatters]

01:04:51.040 --> 01:04:52.000
[Fight erupts | Heavy kick lands]

01:04:52.640 --> 01:04:53.760
[Body hits the floor]

01:04:54.520 --> 01:04:55.680
[Objects scatter]

01:05:01.400 --> 01:05:02.560
[Fight music intensifies]

01:05:16.640 --> 01:05:18.280
[Body tumble]

01:05:28.400 --> 01:05:30.520
[Music fades out | Sighs heavily]

01:05:32.560 --> 01:05:32.800
Sir!

01:05:33.400 --> 01:05:36.280
Whatever happened here... stays here sir.

01:05:38.880 --> 01:05:39.760
You're saying it was a big fight...

01:05:40.520 --> 01:05:42.280
But I don’t see any damage on you.

01:05:42.760 --> 01:05:43.520
I can't believe this.

01:05:44.280 --> 01:05:44.880
Bro are you serious?

01:05:45.640 --> 01:05:47.280
They were the ones who were damaged.

01:05:48.280 --> 01:05:50.760
You should’ve seen our boy yesterday!

01:05:51.520 --> 01:05:52.640
He was ripping their bodies apart...

01:05:54.520 --> 01:05:55.160
Mr Balaji!

01:05:55.520 --> 01:05:58.160
Looks like you’re having a
Baasha-style flashback.

01:05:59.520 --> 01:06:00.280
Back in our village.

01:06:00.880 --> 01:06:02.160
There was always a fight...

01:06:02.280 --> 01:06:04.160
Every fight was full of blood shed.

01:06:04.520 --> 01:06:05.160
Bloodbaths...

01:06:05.640 --> 01:06:06.280
[Birds chirping]

01:06:06.760 --> 01:06:08.400
A very similar one in my life...

01:06:08.880 --> 01:06:10.520
Took me straight to the 'Police Station'.

01:06:11.520 --> 01:06:12.280
Darling!

01:06:12.520 --> 01:06:13.160
Did you finish someone?

01:06:13.880 --> 01:06:14.280
What?

01:06:14.680 --> 01:06:15.160
What, What?

01:06:15.520 --> 01:06:16.520
I’m just checking...

01:06:17.280 --> 01:06:18.160
If he killed someone?

01:06:18.280 --> 01:06:19.160
Hey! Nothing like that, bro.

01:06:19.400 --> 01:06:20.760
My buddy... bro.

01:06:21.280 --> 01:06:21.760
Close friend?

01:06:22.520 --> 01:06:22.760
Dude!

01:06:23.000 --> 01:06:24.160
Come on, tell your damn flashback.

01:06:26.400 --> 01:06:27.520
Bro... it was his birthday.

01:06:27.760 --> 01:06:30.000
I had planned a big celebration.

01:06:30.640 --> 01:06:31.280
But...

01:06:31.520 --> 01:06:33.000
[Comical music plays]

01:06:33.280 --> 01:06:34.520
- Okay Brother bye!
- Bye Brother...

01:06:35.280 --> 01:06:36.280
Look...

01:06:36.400 --> 01:06:38.159
Let's have all the fun.

01:06:38.160 --> 01:06:39.160
Pass it here...

01:06:39.640 --> 01:06:40.880
[Footsteps approaching | Cover rustling]

01:06:43.640 --> 01:06:44.640
What are you looking at?

01:06:46.880 --> 01:06:47.880
Where's the chicken skin?

01:06:48.400 --> 01:06:49.400
It's without skin bro?

01:06:50.280 --> 01:06:51.880
But I asked you to order
it with skin, right?

01:06:52.160 --> 01:06:54.279
Bro, skinless kebab is more delicious!

01:06:54.280 --> 01:06:58.000
Dude, kebab’s better with skin!
Do you even have taste buds?

01:06:58.280 --> 01:07:00.159
Dude! What’s wrong with you?

01:07:00.160 --> 01:07:02.640
- Skinless kebab tastes better.
- Me...

01:07:03.640 --> 01:07:04.400
Eating kebab without skin!

01:07:05.280 --> 01:07:07.640
Dude... do you even know how
kebab with skin tastes?

01:07:07.760 --> 01:07:09.999
- Bro without skin is good.
- Who are you to take decision?

01:07:10.000 --> 01:07:12.279
- Bro without skin is good.
- Hey, Who are you to make that decision?

01:07:12.280 --> 01:07:14.000
- Hey, without skin is good...
- Hey, kebab’s better with skin!

01:07:14.280 --> 01:07:15.880
[Comical music fades out]

01:07:17.400 --> 01:07:18.000
What?

01:07:19.640 --> 01:07:20.280
What happened?

01:07:20.400 --> 01:07:21.399
Is this what you call a flashback?

01:07:21.400 --> 01:07:23.160
And you’re a big don!

01:07:24.280 --> 01:07:24.640
Hey!

01:07:25.000 --> 01:07:27.160
What do you guys know
about kebab with skin?

01:07:27.400 --> 01:07:29.400
Seems like no one
here has any taste.

01:07:32.400 --> 01:07:33.000
After that incident...

01:07:33.400 --> 01:07:36.400
Mom took me to the temple and
tied this scared thread on me.

01:07:36.880 --> 01:07:38.400
I joined this job to honor
my mother’s feelings.

01:07:39.920 --> 01:07:40.920
[Friends hum a tune]

01:07:45.400 --> 01:07:47.640
Nice! At least your story has a good
motherly sentiment.

01:07:48.280 --> 01:07:48.880
Very good!

01:07:49.280 --> 01:07:50.560
[Footstep approaching]

01:07:53.280 --> 01:07:53.880
Excuse me!

01:07:54.280 --> 01:07:56.000
[Pages rustle softly]

01:08:01.760 --> 01:08:02.640
Please have a seat sir.

01:08:05.280 --> 01:08:07.000
[Soft snoring]

01:08:08.400 --> 01:08:08.880
Sir!

01:08:10.280 --> 01:08:10.880
Sir!

01:08:12.160 --> 01:08:12.640
Sir!

01:08:13.640 --> 01:08:14.000
Sir!

01:08:14.760 --> 01:08:15.160
What?

01:08:15.280 --> 01:08:15.760
'Card'

01:08:17.640 --> 01:08:18.880
[Paper shreds]

01:08:20.520 --> 01:08:20.760
Go!

01:08:24.000 --> 01:08:25.280
We don’t need anything right now.

01:08:25.400 --> 01:08:26.400
You may leave, sir.

01:08:26.880 --> 01:08:28.880
Fine, I’ll leave...
just give back my card.

01:08:29.520 --> 01:08:30.000
Sorry! What, sir?

01:08:30.280 --> 01:08:31.640
The card I gave you earlier...

01:08:31.760 --> 01:08:33.000
Please return it, and I’ll leave.

01:08:35.320 --> 01:08:35.680
[Soft snoring continues]

01:08:36.000 --> 01:08:36.520
Sir.

01:08:37.400 --> 01:08:37.760
Sir!

01:08:38.000 --> 01:08:38.640
Now what?

01:08:39.400 --> 01:08:40.640
He wants his card back.

01:08:41.640 --> 01:08:42.280
Card!

01:08:42.520 --> 01:08:42.880
[Chair squeaks]

01:08:45.880 --> 01:08:47.400
Please... somehow manage
and send him.

01:08:48.400 --> 01:08:49.000
Okay sir.

01:08:51.160 --> 01:08:54.160
If we require anything, the card will
help us to get in touch.

01:08:54.400 --> 01:08:56.400
So my employer will keep the card.

01:08:56.560 --> 01:08:57.800
No problem at all.

01:08:58.000 --> 01:08:59.160
Please make a note of my number...

01:08:59.280 --> 01:09:00.879
Whenever you need
our company’s product...

01:09:00.880 --> 01:09:03.160
Let me know, I’ll handle it personally.

01:09:03.280 --> 01:09:06.400
That was my last card. Please return it.

01:09:08.760 --> 01:09:09.400
Okay sir.

01:09:10.760 --> 01:09:15.280
Sir, it was his last card. He won’t leave
unless we give it back.

01:09:15.800 --> 01:09:16.800
Alright. Send him in.

01:09:17.000 --> 01:09:17.640
Okay sir

01:09:19.160 --> 01:09:19.879
Sir, my name is Mani.

01:09:19.880 --> 01:09:23.000
Market Research Executive.
from 'Rapid Access Technologies'.

01:09:23.400 --> 01:09:24.000
Please sit.

01:09:25.640 --> 01:09:26.160
Thank you sir.

01:09:26.760 --> 01:09:28.000
[Muted conversation]

01:09:29.640 --> 01:09:31.320
[Triumphant music plays]

01:09:51.520 --> 01:09:52.160
Thank you sir.

01:09:53.640 --> 01:09:54.760
“Hard work never fails.”

01:09:55.000 --> 01:09:56.000
Time and again we've seen this.

01:09:56.640 --> 01:09:57.760
And today it's proven again.

01:09:58.000 --> 01:09:59.400
We have a success story today.

01:09:59.760 --> 01:10:01.000
And it’s none other than Mr. Mani.

01:10:01.160 --> 01:10:06.000
[Applause]
Team- Wow mani super bro, super, super bro
you're good yes...

01:10:08.280 --> 01:10:09.280
Super Bro.

01:10:11.880 --> 01:10:13.400
We have an incentive of...

01:10:13.760 --> 01:10:15.640
Five thousand rupees!

01:10:16.760 --> 01:10:18.760
- Congrats Mani, Congrats...
- Thank you.

01:10:19.160 --> 01:10:21.160
Team- Let me congratulate you, bro.
Mani- Thank you.

01:10:21.640 --> 01:10:22.400
Team- Congrats...
Mani- Thank you.

01:10:22.640 --> 01:10:23.639
Team- Congrats...
Mani- Thank you.

01:10:23.640 --> 01:10:24.400
Mani- Thank you!

01:10:24.520 --> 01:10:25.280
Mani- Thank you!

01:10:32.000 --> 01:10:35.000
Wow, Mani... you’re our
office hero now!

01:10:37.640 --> 01:10:40.880
What's your secret of success mani?

01:10:41.640 --> 01:10:42.280
Come on, dude, just say it.

01:10:43.280 --> 01:10:45.880
"Behind every successful man...
there’s a woman."

01:10:48.000 --> 01:10:48.400
Wow!

01:10:48.520 --> 01:10:49.000
Great Dude!

01:10:49.400 --> 01:10:51.280
Giving quotes in English.

01:10:51.640 --> 01:10:54.640
Wow! that’s brilliant, my brother.

01:10:56.400 --> 01:10:57.640
You had that cake right?

01:10:58.640 --> 01:11:01.000
Boys! The incentive has been credited.

01:11:01.160 --> 01:11:04.000
[Upbeat party music playing]

01:11:04.400 --> 01:11:04.880
- Congrats mani.
- Thank you.

01:11:05.000 --> 01:11:06.520
Dude! party, party.

01:11:12.400 --> 01:11:14.760
Dude, where are Stella and Priyanka?

01:11:14.880 --> 01:11:15.400
Oh yeah!

01:11:15.520 --> 01:11:16.000
Where are they?

01:11:16.160 --> 01:11:19.280
You know girls... they take forever,
to get ready.

01:11:19.520 --> 01:11:20.280
Correct! Correct!

01:11:20.520 --> 01:11:21.400
Shall we order?

01:11:23.400 --> 01:11:25.400
Hey... look! They are here.

01:11:35.880 --> 01:11:37.159
Okay guys, What do you want?

01:11:37.160 --> 01:11:38.280
Beer...

01:11:38.400 --> 01:11:39.000
- For you?
- Whiskey...

01:11:40.160 --> 01:11:41.399
- For you?
- Beer...

01:11:41.400 --> 01:11:42.160
Beer...

01:11:42.880 --> 01:11:44.400
- For you?
- Tequila...

01:11:46.160 --> 01:11:47.760
Even i will have one tequila.

01:11:49.000 --> 01:11:50.160
To give you company, guys.

01:11:50.640 --> 01:11:51.400
Soundrel!

01:11:51.880 --> 01:11:53.000
You guys will be left alone, right?

01:11:54.880 --> 01:11:55.520
Sir.

01:11:55.640 --> 01:11:56.160
Waiter...

01:11:56.640 --> 01:11:57.400
- Yeah, yeah...
- Mani!

01:11:58.640 --> 01:11:59.640
How did you manage
to crack this deal?

01:12:00.760 --> 01:12:01.880
Ah, that... one.

01:12:02.000 --> 01:12:03.279
When I walked into the office...

01:12:03.280 --> 01:12:06.400
Both the receptionist and
the boss were sleeping.

01:12:07.280 --> 01:12:07.880
Together?

01:12:08.880 --> 01:12:09.160
Bro...

01:12:10.640 --> 01:12:12.000
You saw everything, didn’t you?

01:12:13.760 --> 01:12:18.160
They were sleeping together, not
at the same place, but at the same time.

01:12:18.880 --> 01:12:19.520
Mani!

01:12:20.160 --> 01:12:21.000
Tell properly know...

01:12:22.760 --> 01:12:24.000
Sleeping together.

01:12:25.160 --> 01:12:25.800
I was right... was I?

01:12:25.920 --> 01:12:26.320
Mani.

01:12:26.760 --> 01:12:27.160
Mani.

01:12:27.880 --> 01:12:28.400
Just go man...

01:12:28.640 --> 01:12:29.400
Leave all that.

01:12:30.760 --> 01:12:31.760
First of all...

01:12:32.160 --> 01:12:34.520
Why was Priyanka credited
for what you’ve done?

01:12:35.000 --> 01:12:37.400
Tell that mani sir...

01:12:37.760 --> 01:12:39.520
What my boy!

01:12:39.880 --> 01:12:42.280
Feeling shy?

01:12:42.400 --> 01:12:47.640
No one motivated or
encouraged me like Priyanka did.

01:12:47.760 --> 01:12:50.000
- That's why...
- What, Priyanka madam?

01:12:50.280 --> 01:12:52.159
Looks like you’re HR only for Mani.

01:12:52.160 --> 01:12:53.880
All your motivational speeches
seem to be only for him.

01:12:54.640 --> 01:12:55.520
Hey! Gautam

01:12:55.880 --> 01:12:57.520
How many girls do you
need to motivate you?

01:12:58.160 --> 01:12:59.000
Don’t cross the line.

01:13:02.400 --> 01:13:03.760
[Party music continues]

01:13:05.880 --> 01:13:06.520
Give, give, give...

01:13:07.000 --> 01:13:07.400
Here take it.

01:13:11.640 --> 01:13:13.880
Cheers...
[Bottles clink]

01:13:14.000 --> 01:13:14.880
Congrats mani.

01:13:22.400 --> 01:13:23.520
Howz it bro?

01:13:25.280 --> 01:13:28.399
Let’s go—we’ve got to decide
our pooja costumes.

01:13:28.400 --> 01:13:29.000
Yeah! Yeah!

01:13:31.000 --> 01:13:32.160
It's already 11pm.

01:13:33.640 --> 01:13:34.280
Let's go!

01:13:35.640 --> 01:13:38.280
[Romantic music swells]

01:13:42.760 --> 01:13:48.879
<i>♪ With a stolen glance, you draw me in ♪</i>

01:13:48.880 --> 01:13:54.400
<i>♪ The silence after words becomes
a language on its own ♪</i>

01:13:56.520 --> 01:13:58.759
<i>♪ You’re a flash of lightning ♪</i>

01:13:58.760 --> 01:14:01.880
<i>♪ Stay close beside me ♪</i>

01:14:03.280 --> 01:14:05.639
<i>♪ In these eyes that meet yours ♪</i>

01:14:05.640 --> 01:14:08.640
<i>♪ Time slowly melts away ♪</i>

01:14:23.400 --> 01:14:26.639
<i>♪ The rain that slips in
through the window ♪</i>

01:14:26.640 --> 01:14:29.880
<i>♪ Don’t hold back, let it fall on me ♪</i>

01:14:30.280 --> 01:14:33.519
<i>♪ You came so close, close enough to reach ♪</i>

01:14:33.520 --> 01:14:36.640
<i>♪ Don’t drift away now,
Don’t brush past my heart ♪</i>

01:14:37.160 --> 01:14:40.280
<i>♪ Every day I exist thinking only of you ♪</i>

01:14:40.640 --> 01:14:43.880
<i>♪ Forgetting the whole world ♪</i>

01:14:44.160 --> 01:14:47.279
<i>♪ The moment I saw you to my heart’s content ♪</i>

01:14:47.280 --> 01:14:50.280
<i>♪ Is the one that makes and breaks me ♪</i>

01:14:50.640 --> 01:14:53.400
<i>♪ Like a candy, you had me whole ♪</i>

01:14:53.640 --> 01:14:56.400
<i>♪ Why still keep the truth hidden? ♪</i>

01:14:57.000 --> 01:14:58.999
<i>♪ You hide your words ♪</i>

01:14:59.000 --> 01:15:00.879
<i>♪ But speak with your eyes ♪</i>

01:15:00.880 --> 01:15:03.880
<i>♪ Don’t steal all my words like that ♪</i>

01:15:04.160 --> 01:15:07.280
<i>♪ When my heart asks, “Who?” ♪</i>

01:15:07.520 --> 01:15:11.159
<i>♪ I softly say, “It’s him.” ♪</i>

01:15:11.160 --> 01:15:13.879
<i>♪ There’s no one beyond you for me ♪</i>

01:15:13.880 --> 01:15:18.159
<i>♪ For me, it’s only you, my girl ♪</i>

01:15:18.160 --> 01:15:21.639
<i>♪ There’s no escape, I lose my breath ♪</i>

01:15:21.640 --> 01:15:24.520
<i>♪ Your beauty makes me dizzy ♪</i>

01:15:25.160 --> 01:15:28.160
<i>♪ I wait, ready for love ♪</i>

01:15:28.280 --> 01:15:31.000
<i>♪ Just look at me once, my dear ♪</i>

01:15:46.000 --> 01:15:52.400
<i>♪ With a stolen glance, you draw me in ♪</i>

01:15:52.880 --> 01:15:59.280
<i>♪ The silence after words
becomes a language on its own ♪</i>

01:16:01.160 --> 01:16:04.639
<i>♪ To say all that I feel ♪</i>

01:16:04.640 --> 01:16:07.760
<i>♪ I rest my head on your shoulder ♪</i>

01:16:08.000 --> 01:16:11.160
<i>♪ Even when words run out ♪</i>

01:16:11.520 --> 01:16:14.520
<i>♪ Our stories don’t end ♪</i>

01:16:14.880 --> 01:16:17.880
<i>♪ When I look in the mirror today ♪</i>

01:16:18.400 --> 01:16:21.519
<i>♪ I see you behind me ♪</i>

01:16:21.520 --> 01:16:24.639
<i>♪ Won’t this second last? ♪</i>

01:16:24.640 --> 01:16:28.519
<i>♪ Oh my memory, my love! ♪</i>

01:16:28.520 --> 01:16:29.879
<i>♪ This change in me ♪</i>

01:16:29.880 --> 01:16:31.399
<i>♪ Has been here for so long ♪</i>

01:16:31.400 --> 01:16:33.400
<i>♪ It’s all because of you ♪</i>

01:16:35.760 --> 01:16:40.280
<i>♪ Don’t ever tell me to leave you,
even for a moment ♪</i>

01:16:41.640 --> 01:16:47.400
<i>♪ Why won’t you be in my memory
like a song that’s on repeat? ♪</i>

01:16:49.280 --> 01:16:50.759
<i>♪ I never closed my eyes ♪</i>

01:16:50.760 --> 01:16:52.159
<i>♪ Since you looked at me ♪</i>

01:16:52.160 --> 01:16:55.880
<i>♪ No one else has ever
moved me like you did ♪</i>

01:16:56.160 --> 01:16:57.519
<i>♪ You pulled me ♪</i>

01:16:57.520 --> 01:16:59.159
<i>♪ Into the depth of your eyes ♪</i>

01:16:59.160 --> 01:17:00.760
<i>♪ You’re smiling ♪</i>

01:17:00.880 --> 01:17:02.520
<i>♪ You’re leaving me spellbound ♪</i>

01:17:02.760 --> 01:17:04.400
<i>♪ You put me in a love’s haze ♪</i>

01:17:04.640 --> 01:17:10.000
<i>♪ You’re my angel who came looking for me ♪</i>

01:17:10.760 --> 01:17:12.160
[Footsteps approaching]

01:17:15.160 --> 01:17:16.639
- Cheers.
- I will tell you later.

01:17:16.640 --> 01:17:18.280
This guy is always on the phone.

01:17:18.520 --> 01:17:21.160
[Tense music builds]

01:17:25.000 --> 01:17:25.640
Gopi!

01:17:26.000 --> 01:17:26.640
Are you mad?

01:17:27.280 --> 01:17:28.520
We are the one who'll be caught.

01:17:29.600 --> 01:17:30.960
Take care of them at the office

01:17:32.480 --> 01:17:32.720
Come.

01:17:33.840 --> 01:17:35.120
[Phone ringing]

01:17:36.720 --> 01:17:37.960
[Snoring]

01:17:39.840 --> 01:17:41.120
[Phone ringing continues]

01:17:47.480 --> 01:17:48.120
Hello!

01:17:49.120 --> 01:17:49.960
Where are you?

01:17:50.960 --> 01:17:51.720
Who's this?

01:17:52.240 --> 01:17:52.960
Gopinath!

01:17:53.240 --> 01:17:54.360
Gopinath!

01:17:55.840 --> 01:17:56.960
Are you 'Neeya Nanna', Gopinath?

01:17:57.600 --> 01:17:58.600
You stupid fellow!

01:17:59.240 --> 01:18:01.240
This is your boss Gopinath from 'Rapid'.

01:18:01.360 --> 01:18:02.600
[Comical music kicks in]

01:18:02.720 --> 01:18:03.240
Sir!

01:18:03.960 --> 01:18:05.360
Client place is waiting for me!

01:18:06.480 --> 01:18:07.840
I'm waiting at a client place, sir.

01:18:08.120 --> 01:18:09.360
Okay, which area?

01:18:10.360 --> 01:18:10.960
Sir...

01:18:11.960 --> 01:18:12.600
MG Road sir.

01:18:13.120 --> 01:18:14.600
So, how many calls did
you make today?

01:18:14.840 --> 01:18:15.720
Sir, around...

01:18:16.720 --> 01:18:17.720
Twenty...

01:18:18.240 --> 01:18:18.840
Forty calls sir.

01:18:19.240 --> 01:18:20.600
I didn't count sir, I don't know sir.

01:18:20.720 --> 01:18:21.240
Oh!

01:18:21.720 --> 01:18:23.960
You’ve made so many calls,
you’ve lost track, huh?

01:18:25.240 --> 01:18:25.720
Great!

01:18:26.120 --> 01:18:26.720
Thank you sir.

01:18:27.120 --> 01:18:27.720
Okay...

01:18:27.960 --> 01:18:28.840
Where is Gautam?

01:18:30.960 --> 01:18:31.960
How would i know sir?

01:18:32.960 --> 01:18:34.240
Sir, you should ask him.

01:18:35.120 --> 01:18:37.119
- Who is that?
- Why are you asking me sir.

01:18:37.120 --> 01:18:39.720
Then why the heck are you
speaking on his phone?

01:18:42.240 --> 01:18:43.480
[Comical music swells]

01:18:50.600 --> 01:18:52.480
I called Gautam. Michael picked up instead.

01:18:53.600 --> 01:18:54.720
What are you guys doing?

01:18:54.960 --> 01:18:55.360
Boss!

01:18:55.720 --> 01:18:57.120
They’re the most cunning crooks
I’ve ever come across.

01:18:57.840 --> 01:18:59.720
- It's better to terminate them.
- Hey!

01:19:00.720 --> 01:19:01.840
How many times to tell you.

01:19:02.120 --> 01:19:03.720
Doing that might get us fired.

01:19:04.720 --> 01:19:05.600
We've already crossed five months.

01:19:05.840 --> 01:19:06.720
We’re down to just one month.

01:19:07.120 --> 01:19:08.240
We’ll let go three people...

01:19:08.720 --> 01:19:09.960
We'll retain Mani.

01:19:10.120 --> 01:19:12.480
Sir, I think we should terminate
all the four MREs.

01:19:12.600 --> 01:19:12.840
Why?

01:19:13.360 --> 01:19:15.959
Mani is doing good, He’s showing signs of
becoming a good salesman.

01:19:15.960 --> 01:19:16.960
Sir he's the same sir.

01:19:17.720 --> 01:19:18.360
We don't need him.

01:19:19.840 --> 01:19:20.840
Thank him Manmeet.

01:19:21.480 --> 01:19:24.120
He has gifted an order,
that too in your own territory.

01:19:24.240 --> 01:19:25.240
And you were sleeping.

01:19:26.120 --> 01:19:27.480
If this continues...

01:19:27.840 --> 01:19:28.720
He'll replace you!

01:19:29.840 --> 01:19:32.840
[Tense music fades]

01:19:37.960 --> 01:19:40.960
What were you guys doing
at Brigade Road?

01:19:42.240 --> 01:19:43.360
Three of us together?

01:19:44.240 --> 01:19:45.240
No way... it could be someone else, sir.

01:19:46.120 --> 01:19:47.720
I was at... Madiwala, sir.

01:19:48.720 --> 01:19:49.480
And you guys?

01:19:51.720 --> 01:19:52.480
Banaswadi!

01:19:53.360 --> 01:19:53.960
Banaswadi?

01:19:54.600 --> 01:19:55.360
Can you come a little closer.

01:19:56.360 --> 01:19:57.600
A salesman can lie.

01:19:58.360 --> 01:20:00.600
But not the same lie from every salesman.

01:20:00.720 --> 01:20:01.720
Sir! Promise sir.

01:20:02.720 --> 01:20:03.720
Ancestor promise sir!

01:20:04.480 --> 01:20:05.120
'B'

01:20:05.360 --> 01:20:05.960
'G'

01:20:06.240 --> 01:20:06.840
'M'

01:20:06.960 --> 01:20:09.600
Do not make me use the BGM unnecessarily!

01:20:11.360 --> 01:20:11.600
Look!

01:20:11.840 --> 01:20:14.240
Three of you working in the same territory is
against company rules.

01:20:14.960 --> 01:20:16.240
And this is the last warning.

01:20:16.600 --> 01:20:16.960
Okay!

01:20:17.240 --> 01:20:17.600
Okay Sir.

01:20:18.600 --> 01:20:20.240
Get ready for midnight sales.

01:20:20.360 --> 01:20:21.960
MRE's- Midnight sales? Midnight sales?

01:20:23.360 --> 01:20:24.360
[Brochure hits the table]

01:20:24.720 --> 01:20:26.240
None of you are going on the field today.

01:20:26.360 --> 01:20:28.240
Read our company product catalogues.

01:20:29.120 --> 01:20:30.600
Tonight — you’ll be questioned.

01:20:30.960 --> 01:20:31.720
Do you understand?

01:20:32.840 --> 01:20:33.480
Understood sir.

01:20:34.240 --> 01:20:34.720
Go through.

01:20:35.480 --> 01:20:36.720
[Playful music rises]

01:20:40.720 --> 01:20:41.960
[Door closes with soft thud | Footsteps approaching]

01:20:46.480 --> 01:20:47.120
Gopi.

01:20:47.360 --> 01:20:48.480
Shall we go for lunch?

01:20:48.840 --> 01:20:49.240
Yeah sure.

01:20:49.480 --> 01:20:49.960
What's the time?

01:20:52.120 --> 01:20:53.600
It's already 01:30pm.

01:20:54.120 --> 01:20:55.719
01:30pm. I didn't even realise.

01:20:55.720 --> 01:20:56.240
Let's go!

01:21:07.120 --> 01:21:07.600
[Door slams shut]

01:21:08.480 --> 01:21:09.600
[Chorus singing] ♪ Oh sona ♪

01:21:10.360 --> 01:21:11.960
[Chorus singing] ♪ Oh sona ♪

01:21:12.960 --> 01:21:16.960
[Chorus singing] ♪ Oh sona! I love you,
I love you da ♪

01:21:18.360 --> 01:21:19.360
[Brochure hits the table]

01:21:22.120 --> 01:21:23.120
[Sighs heavily]

01:21:24.720 --> 01:21:25.120
Hey!

01:21:26.360 --> 01:21:27.840
Check this out, guys!

01:21:30.360 --> 01:21:31.360
12 Angry Men, Hey.

01:21:32.960 --> 01:21:33.720
It's 12 Angry Men.

01:21:34.480 --> 01:21:35.600
Guys, he’s a fan of this film.

01:21:36.240 --> 01:21:38.240
That’s why he keeps annoying
everyone to watch this film.

01:21:38.600 --> 01:21:40.840
- Stupid!
- Utterly useless guy.

01:21:41.960 --> 01:21:44.120
Waste fellow.

01:21:45.360 --> 01:21:46.840
[Mischievous music plays]

01:21:48.600 --> 01:21:48.960
Michael.

01:21:49.360 --> 01:21:50.360
Dude! Where's Michael?

01:21:58.840 --> 01:21:59.360
Boys!

01:21:59.840 --> 01:22:00.840
Please don't do all this.

01:22:01.600 --> 01:22:02.599
If we loose this job.

01:22:02.600 --> 01:22:04.240
- Then we'll have to start begging on road.
- It's okay bro

01:22:04.840 --> 01:22:06.120
[Paper rustles]

01:22:07.840 --> 01:22:09.240
- Looks like i'm done here.
- Boys!

01:22:09.600 --> 01:22:10.480
Just look at this!

01:22:11.240 --> 01:22:11.600
What is it?

01:22:12.360 --> 01:22:12.840
Get over here!

01:22:13.360 --> 01:22:14.480
[Mischievous music continues]

01:22:18.480 --> 01:22:18.960
You didn't understand still?

01:22:20.840 --> 01:22:21.840
When he asked her for the time.

01:22:22.120 --> 01:22:23.840
She had a new watch on her wrist.

01:22:24.120 --> 01:22:24.600
Okay.

01:22:25.480 --> 01:22:25.960
You guys still didn't understand?

01:22:27.480 --> 01:22:28.360
Brigade road!

01:22:29.480 --> 01:22:30.240
Titan showroom!

01:22:33.480 --> 01:22:36.480
A 'Sonata' itself is a big deal for Sona.

01:22:37.120 --> 01:22:38.600
And now, she owns 'Titan' too.

01:22:40.240 --> 01:22:42.120
Damn this guy.

01:22:43.360 --> 01:22:44.480
[Doorbell rings]

01:22:45.600 --> 01:22:46.600
[Squeaking door opens]

01:22:48.240 --> 01:22:48.840
Courier, ma’am.

01:22:49.960 --> 01:22:50.600
[Paper rustles]

01:22:58.720 --> 01:22:59.360
Gopi!

01:22:59.480 --> 01:23:00.120
[Metal clank]

01:23:01.360 --> 01:23:01.720
- Good morning sir.
- Good morning, Yeah.

01:23:02.480 --> 01:23:02.840
- Good morning sir
- Yeah.

01:23:03.120 --> 01:23:03.480
[Playful music plays]

01:23:08.360 --> 01:23:08.840
Gopi!

01:23:09.960 --> 01:23:12.240
What happened Gopi?

01:23:14.120 --> 01:23:15.480
The bill for the watch!

01:23:15.720 --> 01:23:17.240
I left it in my pocket, I guess...

01:23:17.600 --> 01:23:18.120
And now... I’m caught.

01:23:18.960 --> 01:23:20.120
I'm so sorry.

01:23:20.720 --> 01:23:23.480
- You want some pain killers?
- Nothing i'm good...

01:23:23.720 --> 01:23:24.240
Gopi.

01:23:24.840 --> 01:23:26.120
For a change...

01:23:26.360 --> 01:23:27.600
Let's go out for a coffee?

01:23:28.240 --> 01:23:28.600
[Sighs deeply]

01:23:29.960 --> 01:23:30.600
This pain is killing me.

01:23:31.840 --> 01:23:32.360
Please... enough.

01:23:33.480 --> 01:23:34.600
[Footsteps fade]

01:23:35.720 --> 01:23:36.360
Dude!

01:23:36.840 --> 01:23:39.480
We are safe... as long as Gopinath
never finds out.

01:23:39.960 --> 01:23:40.360
Hey!

01:23:40.600 --> 01:23:41.600
Where’s Mani and Michael?

01:23:44.360 --> 01:23:46.840
[Ethereal music fades in]

01:25:05.480 --> 01:25:05.720
Hey!

01:25:05.960 --> 01:25:07.120
Tell me, what do you want, you idiot?

01:25:07.240 --> 01:25:07.600
Hey!

01:25:07.720 --> 01:25:08.480
Where the heck have you been?

01:25:08.960 --> 01:25:09.360
Order tea for me.

01:25:09.960 --> 01:25:10.480
Dude.

01:25:10.960 --> 01:25:11.960
Tea came long back.

01:25:15.600 --> 01:25:17.120
[Footsteps approaching]

01:25:17.240 --> 01:25:17.720
Priyanka!

01:25:20.120 --> 01:25:20.480
I need...

01:25:20.600 --> 01:25:21.360
I need to talk to you.

01:25:23.120 --> 01:25:24.360
I'm getting late.

01:25:24.600 --> 01:25:24.840
I know.

01:25:24.960 --> 01:25:25.960
- Listen.
- Can we talk tomorrow?

01:25:26.120 --> 01:25:26.480
But this is urgent!

01:25:27.360 --> 01:25:28.600
[Muted conversation]

01:25:34.240 --> 01:25:35.600
I’m sorry, I need to go!

01:25:39.720 --> 01:25:41.240
[Footsteps approaching]

01:25:42.600 --> 01:25:43.120
Mani!

01:25:43.720 --> 01:25:44.480
Please close the door.

01:25:47.600 --> 01:25:48.720
[Door closes with soft thud]

01:25:49.960 --> 01:25:51.360
[Footsteps approaching]

01:25:54.240 --> 01:25:56.240
Are you hearing any rumors about us?

01:25:56.480 --> 01:25:57.120
Rumors!

01:25:57.600 --> 01:25:58.240
Not that I’m aware of.

01:25:58.480 --> 01:26:00.360
Some people in our office
have no other job.

01:26:00.720 --> 01:26:02.600
They are gossiping and
trying to link us...

01:26:03.120 --> 01:26:04.120
And who exactly told you all this?

01:26:04.360 --> 01:26:05.719
Yesterday even Manmeet was telling that...

01:26:05.720 --> 01:26:07.120
Some poeple are trying to link us.

01:26:07.360 --> 01:26:07.960
Link us?

01:26:08.240 --> 01:26:08.960
What do you mean by ‘link’ now?

01:26:09.360 --> 01:26:10.120
Oh god!

01:26:13.600 --> 01:26:14.840
People in our office think...

01:26:16.240 --> 01:26:17.240
We both like each other.

01:26:18.240 --> 01:26:19.240
Is that all?

01:26:19.480 --> 01:26:20.840
I thought there was more to this.

01:26:22.600 --> 01:26:23.600
Is that all?

01:26:24.480 --> 01:26:26.599
You’re not worried that
people are talking about us?

01:26:26.600 --> 01:26:28.720
Why do you care... if some random
people are talking about us.

01:26:29.120 --> 01:26:29.480
What?

01:26:32.480 --> 01:26:33.360
Tell me the truth.

01:26:33.960 --> 01:26:34.960
What’s on your mind?

01:26:35.840 --> 01:26:39.840
I really don’t know how to express this,
but... I like you.

01:26:40.240 --> 01:26:41.360
I feel we’d make a good pair.

01:26:41.600 --> 01:26:42.120
What?

01:26:44.120 --> 01:26:45.480
[Melancholic music begins]

01:26:58.360 --> 01:26:59.240
You know what he said.

01:26:59.720 --> 01:27:01.720
I feel we’d make a good pair.

01:27:01.840 --> 01:27:04.600
- What?
- He proposed to me! Can you guys believe this?

01:27:04.720 --> 01:27:05.239
I'm asking him?

01:27:05.240 --> 01:27:07.119
Doesn't it worry that, people are talking about us.

01:27:07.120 --> 01:27:08.720
But he’s like, What’s wrong with that?

01:27:09.120 --> 01:27:10.480
He looks so innocent.

01:27:10.720 --> 01:27:12.480
- Forget it
- You tried to help and motivate him.

01:27:12.840 --> 01:27:13.960
But he took advantage of it.

01:27:14.120 --> 01:27:15.600
And how dare he propose to you?!

01:27:16.240 --> 01:27:17.240
He crossed his limits.

01:27:17.480 --> 01:27:17.960
Hey Bro!

01:27:18.720 --> 01:27:20.600
Is this how you propose to a girl?

01:27:22.240 --> 01:27:24.480
I didn’t mean it... it wasn’t intentional.

01:27:24.720 --> 01:27:26.960
It just happened in the
heat of the moment.

01:27:27.120 --> 01:27:27.840
Flow...

01:27:28.480 --> 01:27:30.960
You should be aware of the right time
before you propose.

01:27:31.480 --> 01:27:32.120
Yes Dude.

01:27:32.600 --> 01:27:35.119
From 8:30am to 10:30am

01:27:35.120 --> 01:27:35.720
An inauspicious period of the day

01:27:35.960 --> 01:27:37.480
That’s why success didn’t come your way.

01:27:38.360 --> 01:27:38.720
You're correct!

01:27:39.120 --> 01:27:41.240
We have that inauspicious person among us.

01:27:41.480 --> 01:27:42.360
Then how will we succeed?

01:27:45.360 --> 01:27:45.960
Mani.

01:27:46.480 --> 01:27:48.240
When a girl is showing red flag...

01:27:48.360 --> 01:27:51.240
green flags? You’re not smart
enough to see them yet, bro.

01:27:51.480 --> 01:27:52.360
Green yes!

01:27:52.480 --> 01:27:53.360
But not 'Green Flag'

01:27:53.840 --> 01:27:55.840
If I’m not wrong, she’s wearing
a green dress today.

01:27:56.120 --> 01:28:00.719
But I didn’t see her waving a red flag.

01:28:00.720 --> 01:28:02.120
Dude! Will you hold it for her?

01:28:03.840 --> 01:28:04.840
Come on, Fathima!

01:28:05.360 --> 01:28:07.239
Even you both tease him like that, Right?

01:28:07.240 --> 01:28:07.480
What?

01:28:07.840 --> 01:28:08.840
Did you girls tease him?

01:28:09.720 --> 01:28:10.959
No, Priyanka... not like that.

01:28:10.960 --> 01:28:13.360
These MREs will be working here
only for the next one month.

01:28:14.120 --> 01:28:14.840
It's okay...

01:28:15.840 --> 01:28:18.600
If you didn’t know how to propose,
you should’ve just asked me.

01:28:18.960 --> 01:28:19.960
I would’ve helped you, dude.

01:28:20.240 --> 01:28:20.840
Oh really?

01:28:21.360 --> 01:28:22.120
You...

01:28:22.360 --> 01:28:23.840
begged her... fell at her feet.

01:28:24.120 --> 01:28:26.240
That's how you made her fall for you.

01:28:26.360 --> 01:28:27.360
And now you expect him to do the same?

01:28:29.120 --> 01:28:30.480
Dude, you don’t even know that, do you?

01:28:30.840 --> 01:28:31.840
Don’t you dare talk about me.

01:28:32.360 --> 01:28:33.240
Leave me bro.

01:28:33.600 --> 01:28:35.240
Come on, tell me... what’s wrong with our boys?

01:28:35.480 --> 01:28:36.360
Yo, champ!

01:28:36.480 --> 01:28:38.240
Not a single girl in our company
caught your eye?

01:28:38.720 --> 01:28:39.360
Dude...

01:28:39.600 --> 01:28:44.240
89.42% of Bangalore
girls are very Beautiful.

01:28:45.120 --> 01:28:47.120
But unfortunately... not even one.

01:28:47.240 --> 01:28:48.960
Not even one in our office.

01:28:49.120 --> 01:28:49.600
What?

01:28:49.960 --> 01:28:51.240
You mean to say... Priyanka isn’t beautiful?

01:28:52.600 --> 01:28:53.960
[Everyone bursts out laughing]

01:28:56.840 --> 01:28:57.240
Hey!

01:28:57.600 --> 01:28:59.600
I feel like beer’s perfect for this moment.

01:29:00.120 --> 01:29:00.480
Shall we?

01:29:05.120 --> 01:29:06.120
Atleast shall we have something?

01:29:06.840 --> 01:29:07.720
- I'm hungry
- Let's eat! Let's eat.

01:29:08.120 --> 01:29:08.600
Ok come, Let's go

01:29:09.240 --> 01:29:10.360
I know this beautiful café...

01:29:10.600 --> 01:29:10.960
Let me take you guys there.

01:29:11.360 --> 01:29:12.720
The treat's on me. Come on.

01:29:14.120 --> 01:29:14.960
Leave all that...

01:29:15.360 --> 01:29:16.840
Forget whatever happened... let’s celebrate.

01:29:17.240 --> 01:29:17.480
Yeah!

01:29:17.720 --> 01:29:18.840
It's my treat.

01:29:18.960 --> 01:29:19.960
Let's party.

01:29:20.120 --> 01:29:21.120
Yes! Yes!

01:29:22.360 --> 01:29:22.600
Yeah!

01:29:22.840 --> 01:29:23.480
This is for you.

01:29:24.600 --> 01:29:26.600
- this is for me...
- Pass me that

01:29:27.240 --> 01:29:27.720
Pass that...

01:29:31.720 --> 01:29:32.480
Dude, Mani.

01:29:33.240 --> 01:29:35.360
Don’t worry—you’ll get someone
better than Priyanka.

01:29:35.960 --> 01:29:38.120
[Soft romantic music plays]

01:29:44.480 --> 01:29:45.960
[Footsteps fades out]

01:30:02.720 --> 01:30:04.480
Dude, dude...
she’s coming this way.

01:30:09.360 --> 01:30:10.720
- Hi Babe!
- Hi...

01:30:12.600 --> 01:30:14.839
- What was the urgency?
- just like that.

01:30:14.840 --> 01:30:16.120
I just felt like seeing you.

01:30:17.360 --> 01:30:17.960
Boys!

01:30:18.120 --> 01:30:18.720
This...

01:30:18.960 --> 01:30:19.600
Is my Aditi.

01:30:20.120 --> 01:30:21.720
And she’s a media consultant.

01:30:22.960 --> 01:30:23.600
Hi, Gautam!

01:30:24.480 --> 01:30:25.120
Hi, Balaji!

01:30:26.240 --> 01:30:26.840
Hi, Mani!

01:30:27.120 --> 01:30:27.360
Hello.

01:30:28.120 --> 01:30:28.720
By the way...

01:30:29.240 --> 01:30:30.240
How do you know our names?

01:30:30.480 --> 01:30:31.720
Not just your name.

01:30:31.960 --> 01:30:32.720
Mike has told...

01:30:32.840 --> 01:30:33.840
Everything about you.

01:30:35.720 --> 01:30:36.600
Damn you!

01:30:37.720 --> 01:30:38.840
Guys let's order something.

01:30:39.120 --> 01:30:39.480
Excuse me!

01:30:49.120 --> 01:30:49.480
Bro.

01:30:50.480 --> 01:30:52.720
Bring Aditi once in a while.

01:30:53.600 --> 01:30:55.959
Bring Aditi every now and then.

01:30:55.960 --> 01:30:56.480
Why bro?

01:30:56.840 --> 01:30:59.600
I’ve never eaten this kind
of food in a place like this.

01:30:59.960 --> 01:31:01.600
Don’t worry, my buddy.
Enjoy your food.

01:31:02.480 --> 01:31:03.360
Thank you Aditi.

01:31:03.480 --> 01:31:05.720
- I’m the one paying the bill, dude.
- Michael.

01:31:05.960 --> 01:31:07.360
Thanks bro, Thanks bro.

01:31:08.120 --> 01:31:09.720
- How's the food?
- Awesome.

01:31:13.720 --> 01:31:14.720
MREs- How do you know Michael?

01:31:19.120 --> 01:31:20.600
It's a long funny story.

01:31:21.720 --> 01:31:22.120
So...

01:31:22.600 --> 01:31:23.600
What happened.

01:31:23.840 --> 01:31:24.359
One day.

01:31:24.360 --> 01:31:25.840
[Phone ringing]
You listen to me bro.

01:31:26.480 --> 01:31:27.720
One of our Bangalore roads...

01:31:27.960 --> 01:31:28.720
on that road.

01:31:29.360 --> 01:31:32.360
The boy and the girl. Approaching each other.

01:31:32.480 --> 01:31:33.240
- Hello!
- They're walking...

01:31:33.480 --> 01:31:34.119
- I reached.
- And...

01:31:34.120 --> 01:31:35.720
I'll be there in Five minutes.

01:31:36.600 --> 01:31:38.479
- Yeah, Okay, Okay.
- This is very important.

01:31:38.480 --> 01:31:38.960
In that scene...

01:31:39.480 --> 01:31:40.240
They goto a coffee shop.

01:31:40.480 --> 01:31:42.720
- Yeah! I have taken all the files
- Okay!

01:31:43.480 --> 01:31:43.720
Okay!

01:31:44.600 --> 01:31:45.720
Yeah i understood.

01:31:46.840 --> 01:31:47.360
Bro give me a minute.

01:31:50.600 --> 01:31:52.600
[Romantic music swells]

01:32:02.600 --> 01:32:04.840
Hello! that's my bag.

01:32:05.240 --> 01:32:12.119
♪ With a stolen glance, you draw me in ♪

01:32:12.120 --> 01:32:18.120
♪ The silence after words becomes
a language on its own ♪

01:32:18.480 --> 01:32:21.839
♪ The rain that slips in
through the window ♪

01:32:21.840 --> 01:32:24.960
♪ Don’t hold back, let it fall on me ♪

01:32:25.360 --> 01:32:28.479
♪ You came so close,
close enough to reach ♪

01:32:28.480 --> 01:32:31.720
♪ Don’t drift away now,
Don’t brush past my heart ♪

01:32:33.360 --> 01:32:34.480
Well... this is how we met.

01:32:34.840 --> 01:32:35.480
Right, Michael?

01:32:36.480 --> 01:32:36.960
Michael!

01:32:37.960 --> 01:32:38.960
Where’s Michael? He’s missing!

01:32:39.720 --> 01:32:40.960
His phone is also missing.

01:32:41.840 --> 01:32:43.480
He probably went looking
for another heroine.

01:32:45.720 --> 01:32:46.120
Sorry!

01:32:47.480 --> 01:32:48.720
[Scooter sputters and dies]

01:32:50.960 --> 01:32:52.240
[Scooter kick-start rattles]

01:32:59.720 --> 01:33:00.960
[Scooter clatters to the ground]

01:33:03.840 --> 01:33:04.960
Dude! Where's Mani?

01:33:05.840 --> 01:33:07.240
- I dont know
- Just call him.

01:33:09.120 --> 01:33:10.240
[Tense music builds]

01:33:11.720 --> 01:33:12.720
[Phones ringing]

01:33:15.240 --> 01:33:17.600
Mani, where are you?
We’re waiting to eat with you.

01:33:17.960 --> 01:33:18.600
Can’t make it, dude.

01:33:18.960 --> 01:33:20.359
This bike has become
a trouble for me.

01:33:20.360 --> 01:33:21.120
What are you saying?

01:33:21.360 --> 01:33:22.240
Then what do I tell you?

01:33:22.840 --> 01:33:24.120
I haven’t even started
my calls for today.

01:33:24.720 --> 01:33:26.240
- Go on, have your lunch.
- What dude...

01:33:26.600 --> 01:33:28.480
- I’ll call you back... in a bit.
- Okay bro... done

01:33:30.600 --> 01:33:31.840
[Vehicle approaching | Footsteps approaching]

01:33:38.360 --> 01:33:39.600
[Tense music intensifies]

01:33:45.120 --> 01:33:45.480
Brother...

01:33:45.840 --> 01:33:46.240
Brother...

01:33:46.840 --> 01:33:48.360
I’ll stop the vehicle close to him.
[Vehicle halts]

01:33:48.600 --> 01:33:49.480
The moment we get close,
you kidnap him.

01:33:49.720 --> 01:33:50.360
Show him... the chips.

01:33:53.240 --> 01:33:53.960
Get in... quickly.

01:33:54.960 --> 01:33:55.840
Go, go, go...

01:33:55.960 --> 01:33:56.359
- Go...
- Leave me uncle.

01:33:56.360 --> 01:33:56.840
- Keep going
- Leave me uncle.

01:33:56.960 --> 01:33:58.240
[Car speeds away]

01:34:04.360 --> 01:34:07.120
You know what causes...
every crack in a relationship.

01:34:08.120 --> 01:34:08.600
Cheating!

01:34:09.960 --> 01:34:10.600
Yes sir.

01:34:11.360 --> 01:34:14.240
You start getting arrogant as soon as...
you taste success, right?

01:34:14.720 --> 01:34:16.840
And that arrogance... makes you
cheat anyone, right?

01:34:18.240 --> 01:34:18.960
What happened sir?

01:34:20.600 --> 01:34:21.720
You’re going to lose your job.

01:34:22.360 --> 01:34:23.120
My job?

01:34:23.480 --> 01:34:23.960
But, why sir?

01:34:24.120 --> 01:34:24.840
I haven’t done anything.

01:34:24.960 --> 01:34:25.960
Even I’m telling you the same!

01:34:26.360 --> 01:34:27.120
You haven't done anyhting.

01:34:27.480 --> 01:34:31.120
I thought you’d work hard, be proactive,
and build customer relationships.

01:34:31.360 --> 01:34:33.720
But it looks like one small success
has made you so lazy.

01:34:33.840 --> 01:34:35.360
How... can you lose focus on your job?!

01:34:35.480 --> 01:34:35.720
Sir!

01:34:36.480 --> 01:34:36.840
I...

01:34:37.480 --> 01:34:39.839
I know you're angry on me. But...

01:34:39.840 --> 01:34:40.480
Shut up!

01:34:44.240 --> 01:34:44.720
Okay.

01:34:47.600 --> 01:34:48.240
Look here.

01:34:48.600 --> 01:34:49.960
After looking at your stats...
you still don’t know why?

01:34:50.120 --> 01:34:51.120
It's Twenty Sixth.

01:34:51.480 --> 01:34:52.479
In this whole month.

01:34:52.480 --> 01:34:53.960
You haven’t brought
even a single prospect.

01:34:54.240 --> 01:34:57.120
You were the one... who used to get two
prospects every week.

01:34:57.360 --> 01:34:58.480
I didn’t expect this from you.

01:34:58.840 --> 01:34:58.960
Sir!

01:34:59.480 --> 01:35:00.720
Something is wrong, Sir.

01:35:00.960 --> 01:35:02.360
I’ve got many
prospects this month, sir.

01:35:02.480 --> 01:35:04.360
- Please check with anyone you want.
- What? are you challenging me?

01:35:05.480 --> 01:35:06.840
Then why is your Excel sheet blank?

01:35:08.360 --> 01:35:10.360
I rewarded you for your hard work.

01:35:10.840 --> 01:35:12.360
And now that success
has gone to your head.

01:35:15.240 --> 01:35:15.480
Sir...

01:35:16.360 --> 01:35:17.360
Enough. I don’t want to hear
anything from you.

01:35:17.600 --> 01:35:18.840
In another three days!

01:35:19.120 --> 01:35:21.240
You have to come back with at least
eight prospects. If you don’t...

01:35:21.480 --> 01:35:22.840
I'll terminate you!

01:35:22.960 --> 01:35:23.600
SIr, sir, sir...

01:35:23.840 --> 01:35:24.240
Out!

01:35:24.720 --> 01:35:25.960
[Melancholic music playing]

01:35:41.480 --> 01:35:44.240
Guys, I’ll take leave now. I’ll see you
guys in the evening.

01:35:44.480 --> 01:35:44.720
Dude

01:35:45.240 --> 01:35:45.600
Seriously?

01:35:46.360 --> 01:35:47.360
We’re trying to sort out your situation.

01:35:47.720 --> 01:35:49.120
And now you're walking away?

01:35:49.240 --> 01:35:52.120
I’ll somehow manage
my situation. Don’t worry!

01:35:53.360 --> 01:35:54.360
You’re not the only one.

01:35:54.480 --> 01:35:55.720
We’re all in this... together.

01:35:55.840 --> 01:35:58.360
For the next three days,
we’re in your zone.

01:35:58.840 --> 01:36:01.240
And we’ll push as much ‘COLD CALLING’
as we can.

01:36:04.240 --> 01:36:08.840
No, boys... I dont want to
risk your careers for my stupidity.

01:36:08.960 --> 01:36:10.120
I'll handle this.

01:36:12.720 --> 01:36:13.720
Our career!

01:36:14.600 --> 01:36:16.120
You’ve got to be kidding me.

01:36:17.360 --> 01:36:19.720
This job... it’s just a way to pass the time.

01:36:20.360 --> 01:36:22.240
But for you, that’s not the case.

01:36:22.600 --> 01:36:24.720
You were almost at the stage of
making this job permanent.

01:36:24.960 --> 01:36:27.120
So listen to us. Sit!

01:36:27.480 --> 01:36:27.960
Sit dude!

01:36:29.840 --> 01:36:30.240
Guys.

01:36:31.480 --> 01:36:32.360
Please!

01:36:32.960 --> 01:36:35.120
I want all four of us.

01:36:35.360 --> 01:36:37.360
To make this job permanent.

01:36:37.600 --> 01:36:38.479
That's what i wish for.

01:36:38.480 --> 01:36:38.960
Okay!

01:36:40.240 --> 01:36:41.479
So... what do we do?

01:36:41.480 --> 01:36:43.360
[Balaji mind voice] What do we do?

01:36:45.600 --> 01:36:46.840
Let’s adopt this work
style in your zone.

01:36:47.120 --> 01:36:47.960
If we succeed in this.

01:36:48.480 --> 01:36:49.960
We’ll roll this out in all our zones too.

01:36:50.360 --> 01:36:50.720
Sounds good?

01:36:51.240 --> 01:36:51.600
Okay bro.

01:36:52.600 --> 01:36:52.960
Okay.

01:36:54.240 --> 01:36:54.840
Say it...

01:36:57.160 --> 01:37:00.160
[Triumphant score rises]

01:37:16.480 --> 01:37:19.799
Sir... could you spare some change?
I’m hungry.

01:37:19.800 --> 01:37:20.600
Hey! Go away.

01:37:22.720 --> 01:37:24.360
Hey! Come here.

01:37:25.240 --> 01:37:26.120
Give him some cash.

01:37:26.600 --> 01:37:27.720
Why giving him cash?

01:37:28.360 --> 01:37:29.120
Hey, give him some food as well.

01:37:29.240 --> 01:37:31.840
- Boss we're eating.
- Why is he giving him so much cash?

01:37:31.960 --> 01:37:33.720
- Is he planning something?
- Looks like though...

01:37:35.480 --> 01:37:36.240
Here! take.

01:37:36.480 --> 01:37:38.480
- The dustbin over there? Throw this in it.
- Thank you sir, Thank you.

01:37:38.960 --> 01:37:39.600
Go, Go, Go...

01:37:40.120 --> 01:37:43.120
[Suspenseful music plays]

01:37:51.600 --> 01:37:54.600
[Papers rustling]

01:38:01.280 --> 01:38:02.720
Hey! Whose bag is this?

01:38:03.120 --> 01:38:04.560
And who sent you here?

01:38:05.240 --> 01:38:09.120
I knew it, he’s going to inform the police.

01:38:10.480 --> 01:38:10.840
Hey!

01:38:11.120 --> 01:38:11.840
Let's move...

01:38:14.360 --> 01:38:15.840
Call his father.

01:38:16.480 --> 01:38:19.600
[Phone ringing]

01:38:23.720 --> 01:38:24.120
Hello!

01:38:24.840 --> 01:38:26.840
Inspite of my warning,
you still went with cops right?

01:38:27.120 --> 01:38:27.480
Sir, sir, sir...

01:38:27.720 --> 01:38:28.120
No sir.

01:38:28.240 --> 01:38:29.960
I haven't informed any police sir.

01:38:30.240 --> 01:38:30.599
I don't...

01:38:30.600 --> 01:38:31.720
I don’t even know how they reached there.

01:38:31.840 --> 01:38:34.239
You don’t know what I’m capable of... You'll know

01:38:34.240 --> 01:38:35.599
Sir please sir i have no idea...

01:38:35.600 --> 01:38:38.359
Sir, please believe me... please don’t hurt my son.

01:38:38.360 --> 01:38:38.719
Please sir

01:38:38.720 --> 01:38:39.360
Please!

01:38:39.600 --> 01:38:40.360
Please... Hello!

01:38:40.960 --> 01:38:41.240
Hello!

01:38:42.120 --> 01:38:43.480
Dude... let’s try this place.

01:38:44.720 --> 01:38:45.360
No bro...

01:38:46.120 --> 01:38:46.840
let’s try this place.

01:38:47.480 --> 01:38:48.120
Looks massive.

01:38:50.360 --> 01:38:52.360
But I don’t see any gatekeeper here.

01:38:53.240 --> 01:38:55.840
Come! At least this time,
we’ll sneak in without a gatekeeper.

01:38:56.240 --> 01:38:57.360
Come! Come! Come!

01:38:57.720 --> 01:39:00.480
[Approaching footsteps]

01:39:00.720 --> 01:39:01.360
Sir!

01:39:02.360 --> 01:39:03.600
Is anyone here?

01:39:03.960 --> 01:39:04.960
Is anyone here?

01:39:05.720 --> 01:39:08.360
[Ascending footsteps]

01:39:10.480 --> 01:39:11.120
Dear God.

01:39:11.600 --> 01:39:13.960
Looks like we are in a scrap yard.

01:39:17.480 --> 01:39:18.240
Boys, there’s no way on this side.

01:39:18.600 --> 01:39:19.840
I’m done, guys... completely tired.

01:39:20.120 --> 01:39:21.360
I need some rest.

01:39:21.840 --> 01:39:23.360
- I just need a quick nap.
- Good even i'll.

01:39:37.120 --> 01:39:39.360
Hey... stop it! Stop it! Stop it!

01:39:39.480 --> 01:39:40.480
- Stop it!
[Vehicle screeches to a stop]

01:39:40.840 --> 01:39:41.480
Hey! Fool.

01:39:42.240 --> 01:39:44.720
You’re applying the brake however you like

01:39:45.120 --> 01:39:46.120
Get outta here!

01:39:50.480 --> 01:39:52.480
Who are you people? What are you up to?

01:39:52.720 --> 01:39:54.120
- Who are you?
- I'm this factories security.

01:39:54.240 --> 01:39:55.959
- Who is he?
- He is Electrician.

01:39:55.960 --> 01:39:59.240
- Come on, let’s go inside and sort it out.
- Hey Kuldeep.

01:39:59.360 --> 01:40:00.119
Boss!

01:40:00.120 --> 01:40:01.720
The 'kid' is sleeping.

01:40:02.360 --> 01:40:03.600
Bring him safely.

01:40:03.720 --> 01:40:06.480
- Drop him off, and you two wait outside
- Okay boss.

01:40:06.880 --> 01:40:09.880
[Suspenseful music plays]

01:40:10.960 --> 01:40:14.240
You went behind my back and
kidnapped the child.

01:40:14.840 --> 01:40:16.599
The moment you faced problems,
you came behind me.

01:40:16.600 --> 01:40:17.240
Not like that boss!

01:40:17.480 --> 01:40:20.479
We believed we could handle this
without involving you.

01:40:20.480 --> 01:40:20.960
Sorry boss.

01:40:21.120 --> 01:40:22.960
Besides, You were hurt,
that’s why we took action.

01:40:23.600 --> 01:40:24.120
Massage him.

01:40:24.720 --> 01:40:25.479
Massage his legs

01:40:25.480 --> 01:40:26.840
- Okay! Okay!
- Hold it, Hold it

01:40:28.120 --> 01:40:28.600
Hey!

01:40:29.240 --> 01:40:30.120
Is it just us, or is someone else here?

01:40:30.600 --> 01:40:30.960
No boss!

01:40:31.360 --> 01:40:32.840
- Security and Electrician were here...
- Quiet! Dont make any sound.

01:40:33.120 --> 01:40:34.960
- Get up.
- They’re down... beaten and tied.

01:40:35.360 --> 01:40:35.960
Okay!

01:40:36.120 --> 01:40:38.960
- Something is wrong here
- Ask his father to move the money to another place.

01:40:39.600 --> 01:40:40.960
- Okay boss!
- Dude get up!

01:40:41.600 --> 01:40:44.239
- Quiet! don't make any sound
- Use a different SIM.

01:40:44.240 --> 01:40:45.840
- Okay, boss—done
- Look—right there

01:40:45.960 --> 01:40:49.119
Hey! If his father goes to the
police again...

01:40:49.120 --> 01:40:50.720
The kid dies.

01:40:50.840 --> 01:40:51.600
Okay boss!

01:40:55.600 --> 01:40:56.360
Shut up and sit!

01:40:58.360 --> 01:40:58.840
Hey!

01:40:59.480 --> 01:41:00.240
Give me some water.

01:41:03.360 --> 01:41:03.720
Dude!

01:41:04.360 --> 01:41:04.720
Dude!

01:41:05.120 --> 01:41:05.600
Here boss!

01:41:06.600 --> 01:41:08.240
We're already going through a lot.

01:41:08.480 --> 01:41:10.240
Boys come let's escape silently.

01:41:10.360 --> 01:41:10.959
Let's leave now.

01:41:10.960 --> 01:41:11.680
We'll handle it bro.

01:41:11.960 --> 01:41:13.360
- Hey Listen to me.
- Are you stupid?

01:41:13.480 --> 01:41:14.360
They've blocked the entrance.

01:41:14.840 --> 01:41:15.960
Idiot! it's all your fault.

01:41:16.120 --> 01:41:16.960
Guys don't shout!

01:41:17.720 --> 01:41:18.959
How was I supposed to know
all this would happen?

01:41:18.960 --> 01:41:20.360
- It’s your fault we’re in this building!
- Dude even i'm with you

01:41:20.480 --> 01:41:21.239
It’s you... who dragged us into this place.

01:41:21.240 --> 01:41:23.719
- We should've been little more careful
- Did I ever imagine I’d be stuck in a situation like this?

01:41:23.720 --> 01:41:25.240
- Do something man!
- Wait!

01:41:25.360 --> 01:41:25.600
Boys!

01:41:25.960 --> 01:41:27.360
We have to help that kid... somehow.

01:41:30.840 --> 01:41:33.120
- Do you have plan or not?.
- Say it.

01:41:36.480 --> 01:41:37.480
Should we inform the police?

01:41:38.240 --> 01:41:40.120
Dude! did you hear what he just said?

01:41:40.360 --> 01:41:42.480
We bring in the cops, something happens to the kid—
who’s gonna take the blame?

01:41:43.720 --> 01:41:44.119
Media!

01:41:44.120 --> 01:41:46.840
Someone mentioned the media to me... Who was that?

01:41:47.120 --> 01:41:49.480
- I can’t remember who it was.”
- Hey... was that your friend? Your friend?”

01:41:50.720 --> 01:41:51.720
Who is it? Who...?

01:41:51.960 --> 01:41:52.480
What dude?

01:41:52.720 --> 01:41:53.720
My girlfriend.

01:41:53.960 --> 01:41:55.600
Then just call her, man. Ask her for help.

01:41:55.840 --> 01:41:56.359
Call her, call her...

01:41:56.360 --> 01:41:57.360
What an absolute idiot.

01:42:00.720 --> 01:42:01.240
Hello!

01:42:01.840 --> 01:42:02.360
Hi Aditi.

01:42:02.480 --> 01:42:03.120
Hi...

01:42:03.480 --> 01:42:04.720
- How are you?
- I'm good.

01:42:04.840 --> 01:42:05.600
Tell me.

01:42:05.840 --> 01:42:07.360
- What are you upto?
- I'm at work.

01:42:07.480 --> 01:42:09.840
You know this, right? Mani proposed to Priyanka.

01:42:09.960 --> 01:42:10.600
Yeah!

01:42:11.120 --> 01:42:12.959
- But... she rejected him.
- Tell me something new.

01:42:12.960 --> 01:42:13.360
Oh great!

01:42:14.600 --> 01:42:17.720
Ever since that day, he’s slacking off.

01:42:18.480 --> 01:42:20.599
He decided to work alone.

01:42:20.600 --> 01:42:22.960
Right now, we’re working together
so his job becomes permanent.

01:42:23.600 --> 01:42:25.960
[Playful music playing]

01:42:27.240 --> 01:42:28.360
[Conversation muted]

01:42:31.480 --> 01:42:32.600
MRE's- What nonsense are you talking?

01:42:32.840 --> 01:42:33.600
Dude... what?

01:42:34.840 --> 01:42:35.839
[Phone ringing]

01:42:35.840 --> 01:42:36.479
MRE's- Whose phone is that? Cut it off. Cut it!

01:42:36.480 --> 01:42:37.119
MRE's- Cut it off. Cut it!

01:42:37.120 --> 01:42:37.720
Cut it off!

01:42:38.720 --> 01:42:39.239
Cut it off, Dude...

01:42:39.240 --> 01:42:40.120
Cut it off, cut it dude.

01:42:42.720 --> 01:42:45.840
[Tense comic music begins]

01:42:46.600 --> 01:42:50.120
- Hey! Did you collect their phones?
- Yes boss!

01:42:50.360 --> 01:42:53.120
- Turn off the phone. Put it aside.
- Okay boss!

01:42:55.600 --> 01:42:57.720
- Hey come here!
- Yes boss!

01:42:58.120 --> 01:43:00.359
- Left. Right. Listen to me.
- Boss

01:43:00.360 --> 01:43:04.720
Knowing our limitations, I told you to
stick to small projects.

01:43:04.840 --> 01:43:08.120
See now! what you led us into?

01:43:08.480 --> 01:43:12.480
An incident like this once,
cost my friend’s life.

01:43:13.120 --> 01:43:13.840
You're Father!

01:43:15.960 --> 01:43:16.600
Boss!

01:43:16.960 --> 01:43:17.840
Light me a cigarette.

01:43:18.240 --> 01:43:18.960
Just a second, boss!

01:43:20.120 --> 01:43:21.360
[Lights cigarette]

01:43:22.480 --> 01:43:23.240
Here you go, boss!

01:43:25.480 --> 01:43:26.959
Have you heard of...

01:43:26.960 --> 01:43:27.840
'ODPEC'

01:43:28.360 --> 01:43:28.960
O'

01:43:29.120 --> 01:43:29.960
"Open the sale"

01:43:32.240 --> 01:43:33.120
Boss!

01:43:34.240 --> 01:43:34.960
Not me boss.

01:43:35.960 --> 01:43:36.840
Boss!

01:43:37.960 --> 01:43:38.720
- Not me boss.
- Here boss.

01:43:39.120 --> 01:43:39.600
What?

01:43:39.840 --> 01:43:41.600
Mind if I take a drag?

01:43:43.360 --> 01:43:44.240
Drag?

01:43:45.600 --> 01:43:46.120
Come!

01:43:46.960 --> 01:43:48.960
What the heck is he doing?

01:43:55.480 --> 01:43:56.600
What's happening?

01:44:08.720 --> 01:44:09.480
Boss!

01:44:09.840 --> 01:44:13.120
For us, friendship always comes first.

01:44:13.360 --> 01:44:17.480
Doesn’t matter the quantity
—we share everything.

01:44:19.240 --> 01:44:19.720
Boss!

01:44:20.360 --> 01:44:23.360
Give back their dresses and untie them.

01:44:24.240 --> 01:44:26.240
- Is he serious right now?
- I dont know...

01:44:27.240 --> 01:44:27.960
- [Left] Okay boss!
- [Right] Okay boss!

01:44:37.720 --> 01:44:39.959
- Hey! Call his father right now.
- Boss!

01:44:39.960 --> 01:44:41.720
- And ask him to meet us at a deserted place.
- Hi...

01:44:41.840 --> 01:44:43.120
Deserted place?

01:44:43.720 --> 01:44:45.360
What should we do with them?

01:44:45.600 --> 01:44:46.120
Boss!

01:44:46.360 --> 01:44:47.720
We don’t have enough people.

01:44:47.840 --> 01:44:49.240
Should we add them?

01:44:49.360 --> 01:44:49.960
Is that okay?

01:44:53.600 --> 01:44:55.960
Hey! Where's the other guy?

01:44:56.960 --> 01:44:58.839
One, Two, Three...
There should be another guy here.

01:44:58.840 --> 01:45:00.480
- Boss he is here!

01:45:00.600 --> 01:45:02.840
- Boss he is feeding him.
- What's nonsense.

01:45:03.120 --> 01:45:05.480
He’s forgotten that he was kidnapped.

01:45:06.120 --> 01:45:08.240
Looks like he’s planning
to settle in... right here.

01:45:08.480 --> 01:45:10.240
All our savings are being spent...

01:45:10.600 --> 01:45:11.600
On his snacks...

01:45:11.840 --> 01:45:12.840
and his clothing

01:45:12.960 --> 01:45:14.600
Soon... we’ll have nothing left.

01:45:14.720 --> 01:45:15.840
Hey, get over here

01:45:20.720 --> 01:45:22.360
- You go stand there, Fatty.
- Hey—move, now!

01:45:22.600 --> 01:45:24.600
- Hey. Get over here
- You come, Come!

01:45:26.960 --> 01:45:27.959
What the heck are you doing there?

01:45:27.960 --> 01:45:28.720
Hey!

01:45:29.120 --> 01:45:30.719
Just because I untied you guys...

01:45:30.720 --> 01:45:33.839
Do I look like some kind of clown to you?

01:45:33.840 --> 01:45:39.120
It won’t take long for me to strip you
and make you sit down.

01:45:39.480 --> 01:45:40.120
What?

01:45:44.840 --> 01:45:45.480
'D'

01:45:45.720 --> 01:45:46.840
“You develop the sale."

01:45:48.360 --> 01:45:48.720
Hey!

01:45:49.600 --> 01:45:51.480
What the heck are you muttering?

01:45:51.720 --> 01:45:52.240
Boss!

01:45:52.360 --> 01:45:55.360
We were just talking about your friendship.
I’m sure you had one.

01:45:56.720 --> 01:45:59.720
- Yes...
- [MRE's] Then tell us about it, Boss.

01:46:02.120 --> 01:46:05.720
Fifty-five years... of friendship.

01:46:06.120 --> 01:46:08.239
- A thick friendship.
- Ah, here comes his flashback.

01:46:08.240 --> 01:46:11.240
We were happy with our petty robberies.

01:46:11.600 --> 01:46:15.480
My friend planned a major heist...
hoping to settle down forever.

01:46:15.720 --> 01:46:17.720
As the plan was about to unfold...
the police intervened.

01:46:18.240 --> 01:46:20.120
We fled in the middle of the heist.

01:46:20.240 --> 01:46:23.239
Despite fleeing out of the town...

01:46:23.240 --> 01:46:25.839
The cops still caught up with us.

01:46:25.840 --> 01:46:28.479
At that moment, my friend advised
me to flee on a bike.

01:46:28.480 --> 01:46:31.840
And he would divert the cops
by leading them away.

01:46:32.120 --> 01:46:34.719
He tired his best to escape.

01:46:34.720 --> 01:46:36.840
But unfortunately he didnt make it.

01:46:36.960 --> 01:46:37.959
From that moment.
[Gunshot fires | Body splashes into water]

01:46:37.960 --> 01:46:40.360
I’ve been taking care of both his sons.

01:46:41.360 --> 01:46:43.360
Today, I have neither the 'Diamond'

01:46:43.960 --> 01:46:45.360
Nor my 'Friend'.

01:46:51.240 --> 01:46:53.840
That scooter was all I
had left of my friend.

01:46:54.480 --> 01:46:56.599
That vehicle was filled...
with his memories.

01:46:56.600 --> 01:46:57.720
What Scooter?

01:46:57.840 --> 01:46:59.840
I thought I was the bigger thief.

01:47:00.360 --> 01:47:03.840
Until the day the scooter...
was stolen from me.

01:47:06.120 --> 01:47:07.120
Dude! Come here.

01:47:07.240 --> 01:47:08.840
That’s the ‘scooter’ we have...

01:47:09.480 --> 01:47:11.720
And these are the guys...
who sold the vehicle to me.

01:47:12.480 --> 01:47:13.840
After all this time...
now you’re remembering?

01:47:15.720 --> 01:47:17.240
[Rapid typing]

01:47:17.720 --> 01:47:18.240
SIr! Sir!

01:47:18.480 --> 01:47:19.960
One of the suspect’s mobiles...
just came back online, Sir.

01:47:20.360 --> 01:47:20.600
Where?

01:47:20.840 --> 01:47:22.120
Kadubgere Industrial Area, sir.

01:47:24.120 --> 01:47:25.960
[Phone Ringing]

01:47:26.720 --> 01:47:27.480
I can hear a phone ringing.

01:47:27.840 --> 01:47:28.720
- Is that my phone?
- Hey!

01:47:29.480 --> 01:47:30.360
What is it now?

01:47:30.480 --> 01:47:32.360
I asked you to switch the
phone off long back. Why didn’t you?

01:47:32.960 --> 01:47:34.239
Idiots...

01:47:34.240 --> 01:47:35.959
- Sorry, boss.
- No, boss. We followed your orders.

01:47:35.960 --> 01:47:37.600
- Then how is it ringing?
- I honestly don’t know, boss.

01:47:37.840 --> 01:47:39.480
Boss! Boss!

01:47:40.120 --> 01:47:41.839
Looks like it’s an emergency.

01:47:41.840 --> 01:47:43.600
Can I pick up the call?

01:47:43.840 --> 01:47:45.599
Do I look like a clown to you?

01:47:45.600 --> 01:47:47.960
If you allow it, I’ll put the call on speaker.

01:47:48.840 --> 01:47:49.600
Hey! Give me the phone

01:47:52.240 --> 01:47:52.840
Come here!

01:47:53.840 --> 01:47:55.360
[Footsteps approaching]

01:47:57.960 --> 01:47:59.120
Hello... Rajesh.

01:47:59.240 --> 01:48:01.120
Hey! What the hell did you guys do?

01:48:01.360 --> 01:48:03.119
The media is speculating all sorts of things
about you guys.

01:48:03.120 --> 01:48:03.840
Is that true?

01:48:05.120 --> 01:48:06.479
- What news?
- Hello!

01:48:06.480 --> 01:48:08.600
Bro, I don’t understand a thing you’re saying.

01:48:09.120 --> 01:48:11.959
They’re saying you guys have kidnapped a
high-profile businessman’s son?

01:48:11.960 --> 01:48:13.120
What’s going on with you guys?

01:48:14.120 --> 01:48:15.240
- What?
- Hello!

01:48:15.840 --> 01:48:16.960
Bro are you there?

01:48:17.480 --> 01:48:18.720
Say something!

01:48:19.120 --> 01:48:19.840
Mani!

01:48:20.120 --> 01:48:21.480
Give me some time.
I’ll call you back.

01:48:23.360 --> 01:48:24.479
Mani... what’s going on?

01:48:24.480 --> 01:48:25.480
The kidnappers

01:48:26.120 --> 01:48:27.119
Who are in their mid-twenties.

01:48:27.120 --> 01:48:27.719
Dude... what?

01:48:27.720 --> 01:48:31.240
Working in a Bangalore-based
sales company.

01:48:31.360 --> 01:48:32.719
Famous industrialist 'Rajnath'

01:48:32.720 --> 01:48:33.480
- What?
- Hey!

01:48:34.120 --> 01:48:34.960
What?

01:48:35.600 --> 01:48:36.480
Show me!

01:48:37.360 --> 01:48:38.960
The conspiracy behind this
kidnapping remains unknown.

01:48:41.480 --> 01:48:41.960
Boss...

01:48:42.840 --> 01:48:44.240
Oh, so we’re not part of
this kidnapping, then?

01:48:48.120 --> 01:48:49.120
Hey... come here, kid.

01:48:50.120 --> 01:48:50.960
I'm finished

01:48:51.720 --> 01:48:54.600
I got into a fight with his father
during a cold call.

01:48:55.960 --> 01:48:57.120
What have you done with our lives?

01:48:57.360 --> 01:48:58.960
Now I know why you shared the chips.

01:48:59.360 --> 01:48:59.960
Come here.

01:49:01.240 --> 01:49:03.240
If the police put all this together
and file a case against us...

01:49:03.960 --> 01:49:04.840
- We are finished man.
- Oh god!

01:49:07.120 --> 01:49:07.480
Boss!

01:49:08.240 --> 01:49:09.360
We need to get out of here first.

01:49:09.840 --> 01:49:11.480
The police would’ve already tracked this
location using my phone.

01:49:11.960 --> 01:49:12.720
Brother!

01:49:12.960 --> 01:49:14.120
You’re the ones who got caught.

01:49:14.600 --> 01:49:16.120
We’re the ones who walk away free.

01:49:16.360 --> 01:49:17.240
Yes! Yes!

01:49:22.120 --> 01:49:24.120
Once you reach ‘D’, your work is done.

01:49:24.240 --> 01:49:26.239
But still i want you to understand this
because in six months...

01:49:26.240 --> 01:49:27.720
If you become a sales executive,

01:49:27.840 --> 01:49:29.240
This'll be useful

01:49:29.480 --> 01:49:29.840
'P'

01:49:29.960 --> 01:49:30.720
"You'll propose."

01:49:30.960 --> 01:49:31.240
'E'

01:49:31.600 --> 01:49:32.359
"You'll Eliminate."

01:49:32.360 --> 01:49:32.719
'C'

01:49:32.720 --> 01:49:33.360
"Close the deal."

01:49:36.960 --> 01:49:37.480
Boss!

01:49:38.240 --> 01:49:41.600
The green Chetak,
reminds you of your beloved friend.

01:49:41.960 --> 01:49:42.840
I can bring that back for you.

01:49:43.720 --> 01:49:44.240
What?

01:49:46.240 --> 01:49:47.840
I’ll tell you everything.

01:49:48.960 --> 01:49:49.600
Dude!

01:49:49.960 --> 01:49:50.480
Come here.

01:49:53.960 --> 01:49:55.479
- What's cooking.
- Switch on the other three phones as well.

01:49:55.480 --> 01:49:56.720
- What's he saying
- Take all the phones with you

01:49:56.840 --> 01:49:57.599
Just keep riding your bike...

01:49:57.600 --> 01:49:58.600
all over the place.

01:49:58.720 --> 01:49:59.719
Don’t stop. Anywhere.

01:49:59.720 --> 01:50:01.600
Come back only on my instructions.

01:50:01.720 --> 01:50:02.240
Okay.

01:50:02.480 --> 01:50:02.840
Take this...

01:50:03.720 --> 01:50:04.240
Leave now.

01:50:06.960 --> 01:50:07.480
Hey!

01:50:08.480 --> 01:50:09.840
What are you plotting?

01:50:10.120 --> 01:50:10.480
Boss

01:50:10.600 --> 01:50:12.240
I’ve asked him to take
all the phones with him.

01:50:12.360 --> 01:50:13.960
The police are tracking the phones, not us.

01:50:14.120 --> 01:50:15.360
At that time.

01:50:15.480 --> 01:50:16.960
We can all escape from here.

01:50:18.720 --> 01:50:20.120
I don’t trust you guys.

01:50:21.840 --> 01:50:23.360
You have to believe us.

01:50:23.480 --> 01:50:25.960
Alongside you, we got stuck in this mess too.

01:50:26.240 --> 01:50:27.720
In this situation, he can’t go to the police.

01:50:27.840 --> 01:50:28.599
Suppose he does.

01:50:28.600 --> 01:50:30.120
We’re the ones who get caught first.

01:50:30.960 --> 01:50:31.840
Hey, Right.

01:50:32.120 --> 01:50:32.960
Boss...

01:50:33.720 --> 01:50:34.960
You go with him...

01:50:35.120 --> 01:50:36.360
Send Kuldeep in.

01:50:38.040 --> 01:50:41.800
[Engine roar intensifies | Police siren wails]

01:50:43.640 --> 01:50:45.280
The targets are on the move,
Sampath sir.

01:50:45.760 --> 01:50:47.160
[Police siren continues wailing]

01:50:49.760 --> 01:50:50.000
Hey!

01:50:50.280 --> 01:50:50.520
Boss!

01:50:50.880 --> 01:50:52.280
Ask them to keep the vehicle ready!

01:50:52.640 --> 01:50:53.280
At your service boss.

01:50:54.520 --> 01:50:55.640
- Out of the way, big guy!
- Come.

01:50:58.160 --> 01:50:59.440
[Tense Music intensifies]

01:51:05.160 --> 01:51:05.519
Alright. Let’s leave.

01:51:05.520 --> 01:51:06.160
Uncle!

01:51:06.520 --> 01:51:08.279
Uncle... you're leaving me here.

01:51:08.280 --> 01:51:10.000
[Tires screech as the car halts]
Ey stop the vehicle... stop.

01:51:10.280 --> 01:51:10.880
- Why Boss?
- Hey!

01:51:11.400 --> 01:51:12.639
You... left the kid behind?

01:51:12.640 --> 01:51:13.279
- Oh god
- Get him!

01:51:13.280 --> 01:51:13.760
Sorry boss.

01:51:14.000 --> 01:51:15.160
Idiots!

01:51:16.520 --> 01:51:17.280
Come... Come fast.

01:51:17.640 --> 01:51:18.280
Dude! What the heck?

01:51:18.760 --> 01:51:19.640
He should've escaped right?

01:51:20.160 --> 01:51:20.760
Why is he coming with us?

01:51:21.160 --> 01:51:23.880
Looks like he’s more comfortable
here... than with his father.

01:51:26.880 --> 01:51:27.640
Whoa... you’re heavy.

01:51:27.760 --> 01:51:28.400
Put him in!

01:51:29.000 --> 01:51:29.640
Move... fast.

01:51:34.160 --> 01:51:35.440
[Police siren wails | Engine roar continues]

01:51:40.760 --> 01:51:41.520
They turned Right, sir!

01:51:43.400 --> 01:51:44.520
They turned Left again, sir!

01:51:47.520 --> 01:51:48.640
Sir, keep going straight.

01:51:52.280 --> 01:51:53.000
Sir, immediate left!

01:51:57.160 --> 01:51:58.000
Sir, they’re very close to you.

01:51:59.160 --> 01:52:00.400
Check carefully and tell me!

01:52:00.520 --> 01:52:02.519
Sorry, sir. They’re outside our
jurisdiction now.

01:52:02.520 --> 01:52:03.879
I can't find anywhere around.

01:52:03.880 --> 01:52:05.280
They slipped away, sir.

01:52:07.760 --> 01:52:09.280
We’ve reached. Stop! Stop!

01:52:12.280 --> 01:52:13.520
[Vehicle door slides open]

01:52:14.400 --> 01:52:16.520
I hope these guys don’t turn me in.

01:52:17.040 --> 01:52:18.400
[Vehicle door open]

01:52:19.000 --> 01:52:20.280
[Footsteps approaching]

01:52:53.160 --> 01:52:53.520
Hey!

01:52:54.880 --> 01:52:57.520
At last... I got my scooter back.

01:52:57.760 --> 01:52:58.520
Thank god.

01:52:59.000 --> 01:53:00.280
From this point on.

01:53:01.520 --> 01:53:03.760
You take the kid... and help yourself.

01:53:04.280 --> 01:53:06.159
Thank God... they didn’t turn me in.

01:53:06.160 --> 01:53:07.760
Okay boss... you take the vehicle and leave.

01:53:08.520 --> 01:53:10.640
We’ll deliver the kid to the authorities.

01:53:11.000 --> 01:53:11.519
- Okay! Okay!
- Hey!

01:53:11.520 --> 01:53:13.280
- Nice, Thanks
- Get over there, quick!

01:53:13.520 --> 01:53:14.000
Why?

01:53:14.400 --> 01:53:14.880
Come with me, now!

01:53:15.400 --> 01:53:16.000
Hey! move...

01:53:17.400 --> 01:53:18.280
Where are they going?

01:53:18.520 --> 01:53:19.879
- Do you guys know what you’re doing?
- Why what happened?

01:53:19.880 --> 01:53:21.760
On what grounds will
the police believe us?

01:53:22.160 --> 01:53:25.160
The media’s out there... painting
us as kidnappers.

01:53:25.280 --> 01:53:27.160
And now... that kid is actually
calling the kidnapper ‘uncle.’

01:53:27.280 --> 01:53:30.280
If by any chance he points a finger at us...
we’re done.

01:53:31.400 --> 01:53:32.520
MREs- Correct! Correct! Correct.

01:53:33.160 --> 01:53:34.400
Only if he goes in...

01:53:34.520 --> 01:53:36.999
We can get out of this problem...
I hope you understand.

01:53:37.000 --> 01:53:37.880
MREs- Okay! okay! Okay...

01:53:42.760 --> 01:53:44.000
[Footsteps approaching]

01:53:46.160 --> 01:53:46.520
Boss!

01:53:47.640 --> 01:53:48.160
Boss!

01:53:49.880 --> 01:53:51.880
Handing the boy...

01:53:52.000 --> 01:53:54.520
Over to the police is no big deal...

01:53:54.760 --> 01:53:55.640
But...

01:53:56.000 --> 01:53:58.160
The boy can easily recognize
all three of you.

01:53:59.520 --> 01:54:00.519
If he wants...

01:54:00.520 --> 01:54:04.520
He can... put all of you behind bars—
just by pointing you out to the police.

01:54:05.400 --> 01:54:06.160
Are we going to get caught?

01:54:09.000 --> 01:54:10.400
Tell me... what you want me to do?

01:54:11.640 --> 01:54:12.880
I’ll tell you what needs to be done.

01:54:13.160 --> 01:54:14.520
Please come with me...

01:54:18.400 --> 01:54:18.520
Move!

01:54:19.160 --> 01:54:20.160
Let’s see what you’ve got.

01:54:22.760 --> 01:54:23.520
Boss...

01:54:23.760 --> 01:54:24.760
You're beloved friends...

01:54:25.280 --> 01:54:26.880
The red pouch you mentioned.

01:54:27.880 --> 01:54:29.000
It's with me.

01:54:29.640 --> 01:54:30.880
What? Are you serious!

01:54:31.000 --> 01:54:31.520
Where?

01:54:31.640 --> 01:54:32.000
Shhh...

01:54:32.280 --> 01:54:33.000
Dont shout!

01:54:33.160 --> 01:54:34.159
What is he upto?

01:54:34.160 --> 01:54:36.160
- What're they talking?
- What's the plan?

01:54:36.400 --> 01:54:38.160
- What?
- We can’t... share that with you right now.

01:54:38.400 --> 01:54:40.160
This stays between us,
I'll give it you personally.

01:54:40.280 --> 01:54:41.280
- What is he doing?
- But on one condition.

01:54:41.520 --> 01:54:42.280
What is that?

01:54:42.640 --> 01:54:43.760
You have to surrender to the police.

01:54:43.880 --> 01:54:45.000
Not just that...

01:54:45.400 --> 01:54:49.280
You'll tell the police...
we were never part of this kidnapping.

01:54:51.000 --> 01:54:54.400
